<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ashinna Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka phi imoka yo ichitabu ncheshe nhina Malhehano o Naanano chinohimiacha ukumi ni makhalhelho a Yesu Kuristo. Kila imoka yo chechiyo ineehaniya “injili,” maana aya “malhove Orera.” Chechiyo ichitabu chiyo chilhepiye ni Namatayo, Namako, ashinna Luka ni Nayohana. Ashinna Luka khalhempe mwaha unomwaacha Yesu vekha ayaru, nansho aholhepa mwaha unaacha mitheko chaapangiye ni akarumiya baada yo ukhwa ni uhihimmwa wawe nhina ikitabu yo Mitheko cha akarumiya. Khaawo ata ntu mmoka nochuwelha wo ikekhiaye ikatema vaalhepiye aya Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka, ama ukittu waalhepiye aya. Nansho attu o ushoma enchi anorumelhelha wiira veekinaka yaalhepiye iyaakha cho 70 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ashinna Luka phi lhepilhe, yayo aari abwana mganga. Iphiro ilhepilhe aya ni nuulhumo naya chinowooniha wiira aari ntu o ushoma chinene. Ashinna Luka ahothanana ulhepa rata mwaha unomwaacha Yesu, ahimiachaka chittu cheera aya wo upangia, wiira attu akina apatte ittu yo uchuwelha vanohalha aya ushoma (nlhako wo 1:1-3). Ashinna Luka khayaari Ayahudi (Akol nlhako wo 4:10-14), aholhepa wo iphiro inohalha wooriha attu ahiri Ayahudi uchuwelha chittu chihimiye. Yayo anoonia mwaari wo iphiro inohimiacha aya makhalhelho ni meetelho a Ayahudi (nlhako wo 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni ashinna Luka anolhikaana chinene ni ikitabu chi Namatayo ni Namako, ukhalhawaya anohimiacha chittu chechiyo chechiyo wo iphiro inolhikaana. Wo chechiyo ichitabu ttaaru chiyo, ashinna Luka phi nohiamiacha wo nhina mwaha wo uyaria wa Nayohana Obatiiza. Ashinna Luka tho anoomindelha mwaha wo uhiyerera milhatu (nlhako wo 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) ni mwaha wo ulhapelha (nlhako wo 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Nlhako wo 1:1-4, ashinna Luka anoochuwelhiha Malhove Orera ni uhimiacha nnikwa aya wo ulhepa ikitabu iyo.</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anoohimiacha mwaha wo uyaria wa Yesu ni iphiro chaachokhonlhe awe ntheko awe (nlhako wo 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Vakittu venchi nhina Malhove Orera mmo (nlhako wo 4:14-21:38), ashinna Luka anoohimiacha mitheko chaapannge awe Yesu, hasahasa cho ushangiha chaapanganche awe ni meettuchiho eettuchinhe awe attu.</para>
  <para style="io">Wo umalhihera, nhina milhako milhi chiyo (nlhako wo 22-24), anohimiacha Yesu chenre awe wo ukhwa, uvithiya ni uhihimmwa wawe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Munna nnottuniya Nateofilo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Attu enchi aholhepa rata mwaha waapangeelhe variyari ihu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Aalhempe thoko chenre ihu wo weewa attu yoonechenshe ni anamitheko o nenno nlhove nno toka machokholhelho aya. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Paahi etu, Munna Nateofilo, ukhalhawaya kihowehaweha wo ikekhiaye chittu chonkhaye rata chene toka khalhayi, kihoona vahorera etu ulhepa wo nlhatu winyu, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ni inyu nchuwelhe mwaanene ikeekhene yiituchihiye inyu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaria u Nayohana Obatiiza unoohimiachiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Naherode vaari aya amwene o Uyudea, ahawo anamilhohi eehaniya Azakariya, o nlhoko wa opochera ishaani eehaniya Naabiya. Ahanu aya Azakariya eehaniya Naelisabeti, o nihimo na anamilhohi Naharuni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Onkhaye elhi ayo aari attu aapanga chittu cho ikekhiaye mmiholho wa Nlhuku, attwaraka iphiro cho malhehero ni ikano cha Athithi wo uhikhalha ni nlhatu wo ukhuwachiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nansho yaari ahirina ashaana ukhalhawaya Naelisabeti yaari o uhiyara, ni ayo onkhaye ayo aari anoolhuvanlhe chinene.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Nihuku nimoka Azakariya yaari avaraka ntheko aya wo upochera ishaani Unupani wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Yaari vaathanlhiye aya thoko chaari aya chipangiyaka ni opochera ishaani, urwaa uutusherani ubani umadhubahuni. Paahi etu nkayaarwaa u Inupa ya Athithi. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Attu akina yaari vathe awehereraka anlhapelhaka Nlhuku ubani vaatusheriya aya.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi nkawaakhumelhelha mpaani mmo, nkaweemelha wiimonono wo madhubahu mwaatusheriya ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Azakariya vonne aya nnepa uyo nkayaathukumelha ni woova chinene. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Nansho nnepa wo wiirimu nkaweera, “Azakariya, nhoove! Nlhuku heewa ulhapelha winyu, ni ahanu inyu Naelisabeti anonnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. Mmweeke mwaamwiihana nchina nawe Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Kihochuwelha wiira nnowa mwaateelhiya chinene, ni attu enchi akina anowa uteelhiya chiicho vanohalha awe uyaria! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Nowa ukhalha ntu mulhupalhe mmiholho wa Athithi. Khanowa aawuria idivai mena utheka uriwoothe. Toka vanohalha awe uyaria ni anumwanawe noowa aachariya Iphumu ya Nlhuku, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />ni weewananiha rata attu enchi o Israeli ni waapiiha wa Athithi ri Nlhuku aya. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nowa waaholhelha Athithi, wo machiri ni Iphumu thoko ya Naeliya. Noowa weewananiha manyanaangoro ni achishaana aya, nowa urukunusha mirima cha attu o itiyamaru wiira avire iphiro choombone, ni weesha tayari attu a Atithi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Azakariya nkaakhulha nnepa wo wiirimu eeraka, “Kinohalha uchuwelha chani yayo malhove ayo? Mii kihoolhuvalha ni ahanu aka chiicho ahoolhuvalha.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawaakhulha, “Mii kinoolhumacha va phi Gabrieli kineemelha mmiholho wa Nlhuku, kirumme uwa uhimeriani yoyo nttenga wo urera uyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Nansho ukhalhawaya khanrumelhenlhe nttenga aka, unowa utimira waayaka. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, nnottukiya malhaku inyu, nnookhalha chiicho wo uhulhumacha mpaka nihuku vanohalha aya utimira malheheriyo aka alha.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Yeyo ikatema iyo attu yaari yaawehereraka Azakariya uno ashangaka chani woonaka ahothepa ulhokelha chinene u Inupa ya Nlhuku mmo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Vaakhumme aya vathe, khooria wulhumacha, paahi attu nkayaachuwelha wiira ahoona ithikineha vaari aya u Inupa ya Nlhuku. Yaari athoonyaka wo mathatha.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ikatema aya yo uvara ntheko wo upochera ishaani Unupani wa Nlhuku vaamanlhe aya, Azakariya nkayaahokolhia uwani. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Baada yo uvira mahuku, ahanu aya, Naelisabeti nkayaarupalha irukulhu. Nkayeettelha mpaani mieri nthanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Nkayoolhumacha yiiraka, “Athithi ahokuupuwelha vano, ahothamiha ishoni yoona aka mwaattuni!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaria wa Yesu unoohimiachiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mweri wo sita wo iweyi i Naelisabeti Nlhuku nkanruma nnepa wo wiirimu Gabrieli arwee iwani wi ilhapo yo Ugalilaya yeehaniya Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Arweehe wowo nttenga wa mwalhi mmoka aavekiye ni ntu mmoka o iyari ya Adaudi nchina nawe Yusufu. Mwalhi aarweehelhiya nttenga uyo eehaniya Mariamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Nnepa nkawaaphiya wa Amariamu nkaweera, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu! Athithi ari ni inyu, nhovahiya nnema mulhupalhe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Amariamu veewilhe aya yayo malhove ayo nkayaathemwa chinene, nkayaashanga wo uhichuwelha maana o yayo malhove ayo. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Nnepa wo wiirimu nkaweera, “Amariamu, nhoove, Nlhuku hoovahani nnema. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Nnoorupalha iweyi ni unnyara mwaana mwanlhopwana, nnohalha inyu umwiihana nchina nawe Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Yoyo nowa wiihaniya Mwaana a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe, noovahiya ihiche yo imwene thoko apwiiya awe Adaudi chenre aya, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />ni uwa ukhalha mwene aya iyari i Nayakhobo mahuku o uhimalha, umwene wawe khunowa waamalha!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Amariamu nkaakhulha nnepa wo wiirimu, “Mii ki mwalhi kihinaatameriya. Inohalha wiiria chani etu?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawaakhulha, “Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowuukhuruwelhani, ni ikuru ya Nlhuku inowa ukhunelhani. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, mwaana ntakatifu nowa wiihaniya Mwaana a Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Moopuwelheke tho alhoko inyu Naelisabeti, Yayo yeeriya wiira khannyara, nansho vano ari veruttuni iweyi yo mieri sita, ni wulhuvalha waya. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Khiiwo ihinooria wa Nlhuku.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Amariamu nkayeera, “Mii, karumiya a Athithi, yiirieke etu thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha.” Nnepa uyo nkawaathama.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amariamu anoweetakachera Naelisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mahuku vaavinre aya, Amariamu wo uhipicha nkayaarwaa mpaka iwani yo umiakoni Uyudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aarweelhe mpaka uwani wa Azakariya ni waashikuria Naelisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Naelisabeti veewilhe aya Amariamu aashikuriaka, mwaana mwankani nkaathuphathupha munthunkwani mwaya. Naelisabeti nkayaachariya Iphumu ya Nlhuku <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />nkayoolhumacha akhuwelhaka wiira, “Nhovahiya ibarakha waapwaha manyoopani onkhaye, ni mwaana inyu nohalha uyaria hovahiya nnema! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ki mpani mii mpaka alha akhumelhelhe uwannyaka, anumwanaya Athithi akeetelhelhe? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, veewilhe aka tu nlhove ninyu, mwaana mwankani hothupha munthunkwani mwaka ateelhiyaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Nhoreeriya inyu mwaarumelhenlhe wiira anowa aatimira malhove o nttenga wa Athithi ahimeriye inyu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nchipo na Amariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Amariamu nkayeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Nrima aka unowaathimicha Athithi,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nrima aka uhoteelhiya ukhalhawaya Nlhuku phi moopolhi aka,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />ukhalhawaya hokuupuwelha, mii karumiya kihiphwanelhiye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Uchokholha lhelho attu onkhaye anowa ukiihana mii o mpuha,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ukhalhawaya Nlhuku o ikuru yulhupalhe hokipangelha chittu chulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Nchina nawe nitakatifu,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />uchokholha iyari imoka mpaka iyari chikina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">hooniha ikiriri wa attu onkhaye anaathimicha.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ahopanga mitheko chulhupalhe wo moono aya wo machiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">ni waamwarushacha attu o mahuchuru anoopuwelha chittu cho mu nrimani mwaya.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Haakurushacha mamwene ahoolhelhi vahicheni waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">nkaawelhihacha attu o wiitimarikha.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Haawoniha chittu choombone attu awolhiye ithalha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">ni woomolhacha attu o nhakhu nkaahiya mathatharu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Hotimiriha malhehano aapannge awe ni manyaapwiiya ihu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">ni umwoonelha ikiriri namitheko aya Israeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Hoopuwelha ikiriri awe wa Aburahimu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">ni iyari aya mahuku o uhimalha!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Amariamu nkayaalhokelha mieri miraru u Naelisabeti nkayaahokolhia uwani.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaria u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Nkawaaya wa Naelisabeti wiithaphulha, nkayannyara mwaana mwanlhopwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Amwaatamana aya vamoka ni ashilhoko aya nkayeewa Athithi chinre awe wo woonelha ikiriri, nkawaattapelhelhiya vamoka.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwaana vaapihilhe nihuku no nane, nkaarwehiya uwiinelhiyani unyawo, ni urwaa ummahani nchina na athumwane Zakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Nansho anumwane nkayeera, “Mena! Nchina nawe Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Attu nkayeera, “Nansho woonaka khaawo nlhoko inyu neehaniya chiicho!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Paahi etu, nkayaathoonya waakoha athumwane wiira ehaniyeke nchina naani.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Azakariya nkayaavekelha wiira avahiye ikibau alhepe, nkayaalhepa wiira, “Nchina nawe Yohana.” Attu onkhaye nkayaashangacha! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ni vavawo Azakariya nkayaattukuwa malhaku ni nlhimi naya, nkayoolhumacha tho, nkaachokholha untotopelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Amwaatamana nkayoovacha chinene, ni mwaha uyo nkawaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye yo miakoni Uyudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Kila ntu eewilhe nkaahalha oopuwelhaka munrimani ni ukoha, “Nohalha ukhalha chani yolha mwaana ulha?” Ukhalhawaya machiri a Athithi aari vachulhu vawe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulhohera u Nazakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Azakariya nkayaachariya Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nkayoolhumacha nttenga wa Nlhuku,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Atotopelhiye Athithi, Nlhuku a attu o Israeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Haaweelha attu awe woopolhani.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Honivaha Moopolhi o machiri unupani waya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">karumiya a Adaudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Aholhumacha toka ikatema yo machokholhelho wo iphiro ya anamilhohi awe atakatifu,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />wiira anowa anoopolha wa amalhaponi ihu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">mmathathani mwa attu annipangelha ichimwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Aheera wiira anowoonelha ikiriri manyaapwiiya ihu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">ni wuupuwelha malhehano aya matakatifu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Ahaalheha apwiiya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73">Aburahimu wiira,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />anonoopolha wa amalhaponi ni univaha ntheko wa waakaviha wo uhoova,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />wiira nkhalheke wo utakatifu mpangaka chittu chinothanana awe Nlhuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">mahuku ihu onkhaye.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ni uwe mwanaka, unowa wiihaniya namilhohi a Nlhuku ri Mulhupalhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Unowa waaholhelha Athithi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">wookolhelha iphiro aya,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />waahimeria attu aya wiira anowa woopolhiya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">wo uhiyereriya uwonya waya.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Nlhuku ihu ri o kiriri ni nrima woombone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Noniwiihera nthuko unokhuma wiirimu<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />ni waamwalhelha nthuko attu onkhaye ari mwiipiphini mwo nookhwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">ni unooniha iphiro yo urwaa umpuhani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwaana nkonnuwa, nkaachara machiri mwiiruttuni ni munnepani. Nkaakhalha uthakoni mpaka veechoninhe awe vaattuni wa attu o Israeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uyaria wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Yayo mahuku ayo naholheheriya nlhove ni Akaisari Augusto no waahimeria attu onkhaye aari imwene yo Rumi wiira aalhakelhiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Waalhakelhiya attu wo upacha waari ikatema Akurenio vaari aya atawaraka ilhapo yo Usiriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Kila ntu nkaarwa urii iwani awe wiira aalhakelhiye.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Nayusufu ni ayo ahottuka nkwaha ukhuma iwani yaakhalha aya yo Unazareti Ugalilaya ni ukelha Ubethelehemu ilhapo yo Uyudea, waayarelhe aya Amwene Adaudi. Aarweelhe wowo ukhalhawaya yaari o iyari ya Adaudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Aarweelhe uwaalhakelhiyani vamoka ni Amariamu, ahanu aavekilhe aya aari ve iruttuni, <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />vaari aya Ubethelehemu uwo, ikatema aya yo wiithaphulha yahophiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Nkayeethaphulha nttara naya, mwaana mwanlhopwana, nkayanvilhikelha ikuwo ni umwaathalhelha nnikulhani mwaalhiheriya ashinama nhiilhini ukhalhawaya khayapantte nipuro nhina inupa ya alheto.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minepa ni ashunga o ikhondoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Vakhiviru ni yeyo iwani iyo ahokhalha attu aashunga mihuwo ashelhelhihaka mwiithuphini, alhitelhelhaka mihuwo chaya.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Ashunga anooshunga ikhondoro</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi nkawaakhumelhelha, ni nthimicho wa Athithi nkawaamwalheelha kila vakittu. Nkayoovacha chinene, <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />nansho nnepa wo wiirimu nkaweera, “Nhoove mwaatti! Kinouhimiacherani nttenga wo urera, unohalha waateelhiha mirima attu onkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ukhalhawaya lhelho nna iwani ya Amwene Adaudi Moopolhi inyu hoyaria, Athithi Kuristo aalhehiye ni Nlhuku! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ni nna phi nthonyero nnohalha inyu uhimiechesha, nnokoomwoona mwaana navilhikelhelhiye ikuwo che inamwane ni waathalhelhiya nhiilhini.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Wo uhipicha nlhoko mulhupalhe wo minepa o wiirimu nkawaawa vamoka ni nnepa ulhe, chiipaka ichipo cho untotopelha Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Nthimicho wa Nlhuku wiirimu uchulhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">ni mpuha velhaponi va wa attu anochivelhiya awe!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Minepa vaathamme aya ni uhokolhia wiirimu, ashunga alhe nkeerelhana ashineneru wiira, “Ngwee etu Ubethelehemu noonecheshe chikhumelhenlhe, chi ninohimeriya ihu na Apwiiya chi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Paahi etu nkayaakuviacha ni waaphwanya Amariamu ni Nayusufu ni umwoona mwaana naathalhelhiye nhiilhini. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ashunga vaamwonne aya, nkayaahimeria mwaha waahimeriye aya ni nnepa. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Attu onkhaye yeewa ahoshanga choolhumachiya na ashunga. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Amariamu nkaathepa wuupuwelha mwaha wonkhaye munrimani mwaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ashunga nkayaahokolhia eepachaka ichipo cho untotopelha Nlhuku wo mwaha weewilhe aya ni woonechesha, waari thoko chaahimeriye aya ni nnepa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noovahiya nchina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Yavireke mahuku nane, vaayilhe aya ikatema yo wiinelhiya unyawo mwaana, nkaavahiya nchina nawe Yesu, nchina naakumihiye ni nnepa wo wiirimu hinaya urupalhiya.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorweehiya Unupani wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Mahuku nkaaya wo Nayusufu ni Amariamu urwaa uttukuriyani, thoko chaalheheriya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa. Paahi etu nkayankusha mwaana unrweeha Uyerusalemu, uttukuriyani wa Athithi, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />thoko chaalhepiye aya nhina Malhehero a Athithi, “Kila nttara nilhopwana niihaniyeke ntakatifu a Athithi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Yaarweelhe tho uukumihani isadaka ya akaulha elhi ama makhandi o ikhunda melhi, thoko chaalheheriya ni malheheriyo a Athithi.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Yayo mahuku ayo ahokhalha ntu eehaniya Nasimeoni aakhalha Uyerusalemu. Yaari ntu orera nrima aapanga chaathanana awe Nlhuku awehereraka woopolhiya wo Israeli, Iphumu ya Nlhuku akhalhaka ni ayo. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari anaahimiachenre wiira khanokhwa ahinaya umwoona Kuristo aalhehiye ni Athithi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Aholhelhiyaka ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku, Nasimeoni ahorwaa Inupa ya Nlhuku. Ni yeyo ikatema iyo manyanaangoro ahommwiiha mwaana Yesu wi Inupa ya Nlhuku uttukuriyani thoko chaalheheriya ni Malhehero a ashinna Musa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Nasimeoni yahompochera mwaana mmiononi mwaya ni untotopelha Nlhuku,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Vano Pwiiya, nhotimiriha malhehano inyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">munhiyeke vano karumiya inyu arwee wo mpuha.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Wo miitho aka kimwanene kihoona unoopolha winyu,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />nkoronshe inyu wooniye ni attu inyu onkhaye,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Nthuko wo wamwalhelha attu ahiri Ayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">ni nthuko wo nthimicho wa attu inyu Israeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Manyanaangoro o mwaana aahanlhe anoomiye uwanoni wo chittu chaahimiya ni Nasimeoni chimwaachaka mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Nasimeoni nkaalhepelhelha ibarakha ni weerelha Amariamu anumwanawe, “Mwaana inyu ulha hothanlhiya ni Nlhuku wo nlhatu no upotera ni uhihimulhiya wa attu enchi o Uisraeli. Nohalha ukhalha ithikineha yo uvengiya ni attu <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />chiicho wuupuwelha wa attu enchi unowa uchuwania. Ni inyu mwaanene nnowa ukelhiya ihuzuni yo uweria thoko uphanga wo wiithia, inoohomani munrimani.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ahokhalha anamilhohi anankhwelhi o wulhuvalha, eehaniya Ana abiti Fanueli o nikosho ni Naasheri. Aakhanlhe ni owannyaya iyaakha saba tu. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Aari o wulhuvalha, aaphiya iyaakha makhumi nane ni ncheshe, ni mahuku onkhaye yaari alhokelhaka wi Inupa ya Nlhuku uthana ni uhiyu, anthimichaka Nlhuku, attukaka ni unlhapelha. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Yeyo ikatema iyo yaari anawiilhe unthimichani Nlhuku olhumachaka malhove anomwaacha mwaana wa attu onkhaye aaweherera woopolhiya wo Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhokolhia Unazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Nayusufu ni Amariamu vaamalhinhe aya upanga thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Malhehero a Apwiiya, yahohokolhia uwani Unazareti ilhapo yo Ugalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwaana nkonnuwa ni upatta machiri, nkaachara irusho, ni nnema wa Nlhuku waari vamoka ni uyo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwanhima Yesu Unupani wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kila iyaakha manyanaangoro a Yesu yaari arwaaka Uyerusalemu unlhiani Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu vaari awe ni malhipa o iyaakha khumi khuwa miilhi, yahorwaa unlhiani Pasaka thoko cheera aya mahuku ene. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Pasaka vaamanlhe awe, nkayaachokholha nkwaha wo uhokolhia uwani, nansho mwaana mwanhima Yesu aahanlhe Uyerusalemu. Manyanaangoro awe yaari ahichuwelhaka, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />yaari aanyiheraka wiira aari munkwahani mmo, paahi etu nkayeeta nkwaha wo nihuku phi yaachokhonlhe aya umwaavia mwaashilhoko aya ni manyampwana aya. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Khayaamwoonne, paahi nkayaahokolhia tho Uyerusalemu umwaaviani.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Nihuku no neraru, nkayamphwanya nari wi Inupa ya Nlhuku, nakhanlhe vamoka ni owiittuchiha e Iyahudi, eewelhelhaka ni waakoha chookohiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Attu onkhaye yaamwiiwa ahoshanga cheera awe wo waakhulha wo irusho. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Manyanaangoro nkayoomiya uwanoni vaamwonne aya, ni anumwanawe nkayeera, “Mwaamwanaka, nlhatu waani wo upanga chiicho? Athumwana ni mii naari nuwaaviaka ninashannge.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Nkaakhulha, “Mwaakavierani? Khamwaachuwenlhe wiira ihokiphwanelha ukhalha nnupani mwa Athithi?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Nansho khayaachuwenlhe maana o malhove olhumacha awe.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Paahi etu Yesu nkahokolhia Unazareti vamoka ni manyanaangoro awe, nkeewelhelha ni wiitimarikha. Anumwanawe nkayaashunga mwaha wonkhaye uyo munrimani mwaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu nkonnuwa nchusha ni ukhalha o irusho, athepaka uttuniya ni Nlhuku vamoka ni attu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nttenga u Nayohana Obatiiza.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mak 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoha 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Iyaakha yo khumi ni nthanu yo utawara wa Nakaisari Natiberiyo, Apontio Pilato phi aari aatawara ilhapo yo Uyudea, Naherode aari atawaraka Ugalilaya ni ahima aya Nafilipo yaari atawaraka ilhapo cho Uturea ni Utrikoni. Alusaniya aatawara Uabileni, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ashinna Anasi ni Nakayafa phi yaari Opochera Ishaani Olhupalhe. Yayo mahuku ayo Nlhove na Nlhuku nkanaakhuruwelha Nayohana mwaana a Azakariya uthakoni. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Paahi etu Nayohana nkayaarwaa ilhapo chonkhaye chaatamana mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani, eettuchihaka wiira, “Nkhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu mbatiiziyeke, Nlhuku nouhiyererani uwonya winyu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Phi lhepiye aya nkitabuni mwa anamilhohi ashinna Isaya wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ntu mmoka nookhuwelha muthakoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Nkooroshe iphiro yo uvira Apwiiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">mwookolhe mitalha chinohalha aya uvira!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kila nlhikiti ninoowuhelhiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">kila mwalha ni mwaako unoolhokihiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Iphiro cho uhookwaa chinowookolhiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">ni mitalha chinananre chinoorerihiya.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Attu onkhaye anomwona Nlhuku opolhaka attu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Paahi etu, milhoko cha attu enchi nkayaawa u Nayohana uubatiiziyani. Nayohana nkayakoha, “Inyu iyari yo inwaa va, nhimeriye ni apani wiira nttawe ntwarusho Nlhuku unowiiha awe? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mpangeke etu mitheko cho wooniha etu wiira nhokhoroma ni uhiya uwonya winyu. Nhichokholhe vano etu wiira Aburahimu phi athumwaninyu. Kinouhimeriani wiira Nlhuku noworia uthathusha alha malhuku alha ukhalha ashaana a Aburahimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ipacho iri tayari ukakha mwiri vamithithaarini, miri chonkhaye chihinemma rata chinookakhiya ni urihelhiya vamooroni.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Attu nkayaakoha, “Niireke chani etu?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nayohana nkayaakhulha, “Ntu ri ni ikuwo pilhi ammaheke imoka ntu hirina, ni ntu rini yolhia ankawelheke nkhunanawe hirina.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Attu yaalhiviha ikhodi nkayaawa uubatiiziyani, nkayaakoha Nayohana, “Owiittuchiha, ni hii niireke chani etu?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nayohana nkayaakhulha yeeraka, “Nhinlhivihe ntu upwaha chilheheriye inyu waalhiviha attu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Manyaasikaari akina ni ayo nkayaakoha, “Ni hii chiicho, niireke chani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, nkayeera, “Nhinthurulhe ntu nchurukhu awe ama umwootheria choomwotheria. Nthoshiyeke nchurukhu unolhiviya inyu uyo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Attu nkaayaakhulhuvelha ittu, nkayaahalha oopuwelhaka munrimani wiira Nayohana ayo aari phi Kuristo Moopolhi aathanlhiye ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Paahi etu Nayohana nkayeera, “Mii kinoubatiizani ni maashi, nansho ntu mmoka noowa ri mulhupalhe ukipwaha mii kihinooriaka inakhalhaka uthapulha miripwe cho iratu chawe. Yoyo noowa uubatiizani wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni mooro. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Yoyo hanaa ithelho mmoononi yo ukhungurelha cholhia, akwechaka ipuwa awe yo weepettelha ni uthokoreria ingaano nnikhupini, ni upaha iphepuwa vamooroni vahintiphiaa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Paahi etu, vamoka ni meettuchiho o Malhove Orera makina menchi, Nayohana ahaakurumicha attu urukunusha makhalhelho aya. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Nansho Nayohana yahaachacheracha Amwene Naherode nlhatu no waathelha Naherodiya, aari ahanu a ahima aya ni mwaha wo uhilhoka mwinchi waapanga aya. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Paahi etu Naherode nkayaathepiha uwonya waya, nkayaavara Nayohana ni waattuka ujeerani.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noobatiiziya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mak 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Attu onkhaye vaamanlhe aya ubatiiziya, Yesu ni uyo ahobatiiziya. Vaari awe anlhapelhaka Nlhuku, irimu nkachaahulhia, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari ni iruttu thoko kaulha nkayankorwelha. Ni nlhove nkaneewiya ukhuma wiirimu niiraka, “Uwe phi Mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka. Uhokichivelha.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nihimo na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu vaachokhonlhe awe ntheko mwaattuni, aari ni iyaakha makhumi mararu. Attu yaari amwaanyiheraka wiira aari mwaana a Nayusufu mwaana a Naheli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwaana a Namaatati, mwaana a Lawi, mwaana a Nameliki, mwaana a Nayanai, mwaana a Nayusufu <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwaana a Namatatiya, mwaana a ashinna Amosi, mwaana a Nanahumu, mwaana a Naesili, mwaana a Nanagai <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwaana a Namaathi, mwaana a Namatatiya, mwaana a Nasemeini, mwaana a Nayoseki, mwaana a Nayoda <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwaana a Nayoanani, mwaana a Nareesa, mwaana a Nazerubabeli, mwaana a Nashaltieli, mwaana a Naneeri <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwaana a Nameliki, mwaana a Naadi, mwaana a Nakosamu, mwaana a Naelimadamu, mwaana a Nanaeri <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwaana a Nayoshua, mwaana a Naelieza, mwaana a Nayorimu, mwaana a Namaatati, mwaana a Nalawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwaana a Nasimeoni, mwaana a Nayuda, mwaana a Nayusufu, mwaana a Nayonamu, mwaana a Naeliakimu <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwaana a Namelea, mwaana a Namena, mwaana a Namatata, mwaana a Nanathani, mwaana a Adaudi <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwaana a Nayese, mwaana a Naobedi, mwaana a Naboazi, mwaana a Nasalmoni, mwaana a Nanashoni <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwaana a Naaminaadabu, mwaana a Naadimini, mwaana a Naarni, mwaana a Nahezironi, mwaana a Nafarisi, mwaana a Nayuda <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwaana a Nayakhobo, mwaana a Naisaka, mwaana a Aburahimu, mwaana a Natera, mwaana a Nanaahori <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwaana a Naserugi, mwaana a Nareu, mwaana a Napelegi, mwaana a Naeberi, mwaana a Nashela <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwaana a Nakainani, mwaana a Naarfakisadi, mwaana a Nashemu, mwaana a Anuhu, mwaana a Nalameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwaana a Nametusela, mwaana a Nahenoko, mwaana a Nayaredi, mwaana a Namahalaleli, mwaana a Nakainamu <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />aari mwaana a Naenoshi, mwaana a Naseeti, mwaana a Adamu, aari mwaana a Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ulhikachiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2-13">Mak 1:2-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu nkaahokolhia Uyorodani nachanre Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nkaahoolhelhiya ni Iphumu mpaka uthakoni, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />waalhikachiye awe ni Nakare wo mahuku makhumi ncheshe. Mahuku onkhaye ayo ahottuka wo uhilhia ittu, paahi etu avireke yayo mahuku ayo nkaawolhiya ithalha. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Nakare nkaamwirelha, “Wakhalhaka uwe phi Mwaana a Nlhuku, ulheehereke etu wiira alha malhuku alha athathuwe nkatte.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Ntu khanlhama wo ulhia nkatte vekha.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Nakare nkankusha tho mpaka vachulhu ni umwooniha imwene chonkhaye cho velhaponi va. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Nakare nkeera, “Kinouvaha ikuru wo chilha imwene chonkhaye chi ni urera waya. Chonkhaye chi chiri mmathathani mwaka, kathananaka ummaha ntu kinowooria. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Mwakikhoromelhaka ni ukithimicha, chonkhaye chi chinookhalha chawinyu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “iholhepiya, ‘Mwaathimicheke Athithi, Nlhuku inyu vekha aya ni uvara mitheko chaya!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Nakare nkanrweeha mpaka Uyerusalemu vachulhu ishanja yo Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkeera, “Wakhalhaka uwe phi Mwaana a Nlhuku, paahi etu uthupeke mpaka vathi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Nlhuku noolhehera minepa chawe chiwe chuwopolheni.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Ni vawo tho aneera wiira, ‘Anoukushani mmathathani mwaya nhiwe mwaarakalha mmalhukuni.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Iholhepiya, ‘Nhinlhikache Nlhuku, Athithi inyu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Nakare amalheke unlhikacha Yesu wo kila iphiro, nkanhiya mpaka ikatema inothananiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noochokholha ntheko awe Ugalilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mak 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Paahi Yesu ahohokolhia Ugalilaya, ni ikuru yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku yaari vamoka ni uyo. Mwaha unomwaacha nkawaawanelha mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nkeettuchiha mu inupa chaya cho unlhapelha Nlhuku, nkaatotopelhiya ni attu onkhaye.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nookhotiya Unazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mak 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Paahi etu Yesu nkaarwa Unazareti, iwani yonnuwenlhe awe, ni Nihuku no Wiittuwa nkaarwa u inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku thoko chaalhemalhenlhe awe. Nkeemelha ushoma Malhove Matakatifu <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />nkaavahiya nrapalha naalhepiye Malhove Matakatifu ni anamilhohi ashinna Isaya wiira ashome. Nkaapatakulha ni ushoma vakittu valhepiye wiira,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Iphumu ya Athithi uri vamoka ni mii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ukhalhawaya ahokihika makhura wiira kaahimerie Malhove Orera amashikini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Ahokiruma kihimiache uhiyereriya attu attukiye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ni woonihiya tho attu ahinoona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ni woopolha attu anohuvihiya<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />ni uhimiacha wiira ikatema ihaaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">Athithi vanohalha aya woopolha attu aya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu nkaavilhika ikitabu ni uhokolhosha wa namitheko aashunga, nkaakhalha vathi. Attu onkhaye wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku mmo nkayammweha wo miitho melhi paranda, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />venre awe, “Alha Malhove Matakatifu alha ahotimira lhelho, thoko chinre inyu wo wiiwa kishomaka.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Attu onkhaye nkayaachivelhiya, nkayaashangacha wiiwa malhove o nnema aahimiacha awe. Nkayaakohanacha yeeraka, “Ana ulha kahiwena mwaana a Nayusufu ulha?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Nkeerelha wiira, “Kihochuwelha wiira nnookiirelha nlhikaaniho no wiira, ‘Namirete, wiilhamiheke umwanene.’ Ni ukiirelha tho kipangache chittu mwiiwilhe inyu kipangachaka Ukapenaumu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />“Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye tho wiira, anamilhohi khanolhohiya uwannyaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />“Nansho nkakiiweni, wo ikekhiaye, wahokhalha anankhwelhi enchi mwiilhaponi mu Israeli mwonkhaye mu ikatema i Naeliya, irimu vaattukiye aya, ni ipulha khayarumpe iyaakha ttaaru ni nusu ni ikuruna nkayaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ni Naeliya khayaarumiye wa anankhwelhi ariyoothe ahikhalhe anankhwelhi yaakhalha Userepta umwiinanoni ni ilhapo yo Usidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Tho, yahaawo attu enchi yaawereiya makutulha mwiilhaponi mu Israeli Naelisha vaari aya anamilhohi, nansho khaawo ntu aalhamme ahikhalhe Nanaamani, ntu o Usiriya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Attu onkhaye yaari inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku veewilhe aya chiicho, nkayaarushiya. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Nkayeemelhacha, nkayankhweremiha uchereshere iwani ni unkusha mpaka vachereshere mwaako wiira ankakhelhe vathi wuuthi mwaako, <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />nansho nkaavira variyari aya ni urwaa.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntu o mashoka o unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mak 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Paahi Yesu nkaarwa Ukapenaumu, iwani yaari Ugalilaya, nkeettuchiha attu Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Attu onkhaye yaari ashangaka chettuchiha awe, ukhalhawaya olhumacha wo ikuru. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Nkaakhalha ntu o mashoka o unanara wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku mmo, akhuwelha chinene, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Niuttekenlheni hii, uwe Yesu o Nazareti? Uwilhe unoomolha? Kihochuwelha chinre awo, uwe phi karumiya ntakatifu a Nlhuku!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu nkoomolha nshoka no unanara nno, “Mmaalhe munkhume ulha ntu ulha!” Nshoka nkanammulhusha ntu ulhe vathi, nkanaathama wo hinrakalhiha. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Attu onkhaye nkayoomiya uwanoni olhumachaka ashineneru, “Ilha phi ishiyani vano? Wo machiri ni ikuru yolha ntu ulha nolhehera wiira mashoka o unanara, athamache, ni ayo anoothamacha!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Mwaha wa Yesu nkawaawanelha kila vakittu velhaponi vawo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu enchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mak 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu nkaathama wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku nkaakelha unupani wa Nasimoni. Wowo ahokohi aya Nasimoni yaari areta iruttu, Yesu nkaahimeriya. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Nkaarwa vaathalhelhiye aya ni weemelha vachereshere ikori ni woomolha ureta waathame apwiyawe ayo. Ureta nkawaalhama, nkayaachokholha waaterekhelha.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Uchechilho, attu yaari ni manyampwana aya yaawereia nkayaawiihacha areta ayo wa Yesu, ni uyo nkeesheracha miono chawe kila mmoka nkayaalhamacha. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mashoka o unanara ni ayo nkaayathamacha attu enchi, olhumachaka, “Uweva phi Mwaana a Nlhuku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Yesu nkoomolha mashoka o unanara wiira ahihokolhiache tho ni ayo khayoolhumanche tho, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha wiira aari phi Kuristo Moopolhi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowiittuchiha wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mak 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Waashelhe waya Yesu ahothama vawani vawo, nkaarwa vakittu vaari awe yeekha. Attu khayaachokholha umwaavia, vaamwonne aya, nkayanchiichiha wiira hithame uwannyaya. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Nansho nkeerelhacha, “Kihophwanelhiya uhimiacha Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku iwani chikina, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku kirumme wiira kipange yoyo ntheko uyo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Paahi etu nkaavira eettuchihachaka attu mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uyudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu noweehana Owiittucha o upachera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mak 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari neemenlhe vachengweni nttiya no Genesareti, attu vaathothokanacha aya uwa uwiiwelhelhani nlhove na Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Nkoona ikalhava pilhi vachereshere nttiya, ashinene yaari anakhuruwilhe alhokihachaka ittavi chaya. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu nkaawelha ikalhava imoka i Nasimoni, nkaalhepelha anene ayo wiira athame vachengweni vawo achusheriheke miholho vakani. Nkaakhalha nkalhavani mmo ni weettuchiha milhoko cha attu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Amalhiheke weettuchiha attu, nkeerelha Nasimoni, “Nchusheriheke ikalhava inyu mpaka variyari nttiya, mwarieke ittavi chinyu chiyo mwavare ihopa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Nasimoni nkayaakhulha, “Thithi, nihoshelhelhiha wo uhipatta ittu. Nansho wo nlhove ninyu, kinokoriaa ittavi vano.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Arieke ittavi mmaashini, nkayaarulha ihopa chinchi, mpaka ittavi waatameria upaphuwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nkayeehana ashikhunanaya yaari ikalhava ikina, awe aakaviha. Nkayaawacha, nkayaacharihacha ihopa ikalhava pilhi chonkhaye chaatameriaka utitimira mmaashini.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Nasimoni Peturo voonne aya ikhumelhenlhe, nkayankhoromelha Yesu amwiirelhaka, “Nthame vawannnyaka va, Thithi! Ki ntu o uwonya mii!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Napeturo anene vamoka ni ashikhunanaya nkayoomachiya uwanoni wo woona ihopa chinchi thoko chechiyo chaavarilhe aya chiyo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yaari chiicho ata u Nayakhobo ni Nayohana ashaana a Nazebedayo, akavihi nanaya Nasimoni. Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhoovache mwaatti, uchokholha lhelho va nnookhalha o woopolha attu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Nkayaapurulha ikalhava mpaka uchengweni, nkayaahiya kila ittu ni unttwara Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu o makutulha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mak 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Nkayaakhalha wiira Yesu vaari awe iwani imoka ntu mmoka aawereiya makutulha ahomwoona, nkaawa wa Yesu. Nkeewulhusha makukhu ni unlhepelha Yesu, “Thithi, mwattunaka, nnowooria ukilhamiha!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu nkookolha moono awe ni ummara ntu o makutulha uyo nkaamwiirelha, “Kihothanana, nlhameke etu!” <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Nkanlhehera ntu uyo wiira, “Nhirwee uhimiecheshani wa attu, nansho nrweeke mweechoniheke wa opochera ishaani, mwakumiheke isadaka inyu mwiittukurie wiira nholhama thoko chilheheriye aya ni ashinna Musa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Nansho mwaha waapannge awe Yesu nkawaawanelha kila vakittu. Attu enchi nkayaathukumana uumwiiwelhelhani ni ulhamihiya mareta aya. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Nansho nkaathama ni urwaa vakittu vo yekha awe, nkaakhalha wowo anlhapelhaka Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu o ririyacha moono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mak 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari eettuchihaka, Amafarisayo akina ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yaakhumme iwani cho Ugalilaya ni Uyudea ni Uyerusalemu, yaakhalhanche eewelhelhaka. Machiri a Athithi aari vamoka ni uyo wiira aalhamihe areta. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Nkayaawa attu yankushilhe vankorini ntu o uririyacha iruttu, nkayaalhikacha unkelhiha mpaani mwaari awe Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Nansho attu chenre aya wo uchara, khayoonrie ukelha mpaani. Paahi etu, nkayankusha mpaka vachulhu nchaara, nkayaakhunulha nivatho wiira anvirihe ni ikori awe mpaka vaari awe Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Attu anomperetiha nreta vanchaarani</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu vonne awe yoyo nrima aya uyo, nkaamwirelha ntu o ririyacha moono uyo, “Uhohiyereriya uwonya wao, mpwana aka.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Owiittuchiha Malhehero ni Amafarisayo nkayaachokholha wiikoha ashineneru, “Ana phi mpani yolha nonlhava Nlhuku ulha! Nlhuku vekha awe phi nohiyerera uwonya!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu ahochuwelha ichuku chaya, nkeera, “Nlhatu waani wo uchukulhacha munrimani chiicho? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Vaalhuwilhe vayi ana, wiira, ‘Uwonya winyu uhohiyereriya,’ ama wiira, ‘Munkweke nrweeke?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Kinowoonihani etu wiira, Mwaana a Ntu hanaa ikuru velhaponi va yo uhiyerera uwonya wa attu.” Paahi etu nkaamwiirelha ntu o moono wo uririyacha ulhe, “Kinoohimeriani wiira, munkweke, mwiirieke nkori inyu nhokolhieke uwani!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Vavawo vavawo ntu ulhe nkeemelha attu yoonaka, nkaakusha nkori waarupelha awe, nkaahokolhia uwannyawe, anthimichaka Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Attu onkhaye nkayaahalha malhaku mwaari! Aari yoovaka, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku yiiraka, “Nihoona chittu cho ushangiha lhelho!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noweehana Nalawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mak 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Yamalhekeru, Yesu nkaakhuma vathe nkaamwona ntu aalhiviha ikhodi eehaniya Lawi, nakhanlhe vanupani vaalhiviha awe ikhodi. Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Nkittware.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Nalawi nkayeemelha, nkayaahiya kila ittu ni unttwara Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Yamalheke Nalawi nkayanterekhelha Yesu yolhia yo uchechilho, ni alheto yaalhalheiye yaari attu olhiviha ikhodi enchi aakhanlhe unlhiana Yesu vamoka ni attu akina. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Amafarisayo akina ni owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachukulha, nkayaakoha owiittucha a Yesu yeeraka, “Chani woonaka mwaatti nnolhia ni uwuria vamoka ni attu o ulhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Attu arii akumi khanaavia abwana mganga, ihikhalhe areta phi naavia. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Akiwiilhe u weehanani attu anopanga chittu cho urera wiira akhorome, nansho attu o uwonya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo uttuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mak 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Attu akina nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Owiittucha a Nayohana anoottuka venchi ni ulhapelha, ni owiittucha a Amafarisayo anopanga chiicho, nansho owiittucha inyu anolhia ni uwuria.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani attu alhalheiye u arusini ahophwanelhiya uttuka abwana arusi anari vavawo? Mena! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Nansho nihuku ninoowa abwana arusi vanowa aya uthamihiya, vavawo attu phi nowa aya aattuka.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu nkaahimeria tho nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Khaawo ntu neesha imbaati yo naanano vachulhu ikuwo yoothalha. Eeraka chiicho, noothepiha ikuwo iyo waahuwa, ni imbaati iyo khinaathana ni ikuwo yo khalhayi. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Chiicho khaawo ntu nohelha idivai yoochasha ntumpa wo nrapalha wo wuulhuvalha, ukhalhawaya idivai yoochasha iyo inoopwesha ntumpa uyo ni urihiaa. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Nansho, idivai yoochasha inohelhiya mu nrupa nkumi! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Khaawo ntu nothanana uwuria idivai ihinachasha amalhihaka uwuria idivai yoochasha. Attu aneera, ‘Ittu yo khalhayi phi nlhoka chinene.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo Nihuku no Wiittuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Yesu aari etakachaka mmamatani Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Owiittucha awe nkayonthacha machashi o meelhe, nkayaatikitta ni ukhuura imbeyu chaya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Amafarisayo akina nkayaakoha, “Nlhatu waani upanga ittu ichiichihiye ni Malhehero wiira ihipangiye Nihuku no Wiittuwa?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ana khannashoma yaapannge aya Adaudi ni ashikhunanaya vaawolhiye aya ithalha? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ahokelha Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkayaalha mikatte chaakumihiye isadaka wa Nlhuku, nkayaalhia, ni waakawelha ashikhunanaya. Mikatte chaachiichihiye ulhiya ni attu akina yaakhihale opochera ishaani vekha aya.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu nkaamalhiha eeraka, “Mwaana a Ntu phi Mwanene Nihuku no Wiittuwa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntu o moono wo ririyacha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16">Mak 3:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Nihuku no Wiittuwa nikina, Yesu ahorwaa wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ni wettuchiha attu. Ahokhalha mwommo ntu o moono wo uririyacha. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Owiittuchiha Malhehero akina ni Amafarisayo nkayaavia nlhatu wo mwootheria wiira hotteka, paahi etu nkayammweha paranda yoone yakhalhaka nonlhamiha ntu uyo Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha ichuku chaya nkaamwirelha ntu ulhe, “Munkweke mmweeke. Mweemelhe uholho unouno.” Nkeemelha nkaawa uholho. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Paahi Yesu nkeerelha, “Kinoukohani mwaatti, Ikekhia ihu inaacha Nihuku no Wiittuwa inonilhehera nipangekeni lhelho? Upanga ittu yo urera ama yo uhilhoka? Woopolha ukumi wa ntu ama wiiva?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Nkaaweha attu onkhaye yaari vavawo, nkaamwirelha ntu o moono wo uririyacha ulhe, “Wookolheke moono awo uyo.” Nkookolha, nkawaalhama nkawaakhalha nkumi tho.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Nansho attu yanvenga Yesu nkayaathunalhacha, nkayaakhalha ashineneru yaaviaka nlhatu wo umwiiriha Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaathanlha akarumiya khumi ni elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mak 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Yesu nkaarwa umwaakoni ulhepelhani, nkaashelhelhiha wowo anlhapelhaka Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Waashelhe waya, nkeehanacha owiittucha awe ni waathanlha khumi ni elhi, ehanne awe akarumiya, <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Nasimoni aavanhe awe nchina Napeturo ni ahima aya Naandorea ni Nayakhobo ni Nayohana ni Nafilipo ni Nabatolomayo <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Namatayo ni Natomaso ni Nayakhobo ashaana a Alufayo ni Nasimoni eehaniya nnenchi <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Nayuda mwaamwanaa Nayakhobo ni Yuda Isikariote, anthuminhe Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowiittuchiha ni waalhamiha attu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Vaakhuruwilhe awe umwaakoni ni akarumiya awe, nkeemelha ni waaphwanya owiittuchiha awe enchi anathothokanne vamoka. Yayo yaari attu yaakhumme ilhapo cho Uyudea ni Uyerusalemu ni iwani cho umbwaani cho Utiro ni Usidoni, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />aawachilhe umwiiwelhelhani ni uwa uulhamihiyani mareta aya. Attu yaahuvihiya ni mashoka o unanara ni ayo ahowaacha uulhamihiyani. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Attu onkhaye yaari athananaka inakhalhaka uvara mwiinjiro wawe, ukhalhawaya machiri aari ankhumaka ni waalhamiha attu onkhaye.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpuha ni ihuzuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu nkaaweha owiittucha awe nkeera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Nhoreeriya mwaatti nnohuvelha unchuwelha Nlhuku va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">umwene wa Nlhuku phi wawinyu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Nhoreeriya mwaatti nnowolhiya ithalha va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaawonihiya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Nhoreeriya mwaatti nnonlha vano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaathiaa ni uteelhiya!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Nhoreeriya mwaatti vanopangelhiya inyu ichimwa ni attu, okhotakani, oruwanakani ni uheulhacha nchina ninyu wiira nhopanga ittu yo uhilhoka wo nlhatu wo Mwaana a Ntu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nteelhiyeke vanohalha aya ukhumelhelha yayo, ntapelhelheke wo ushangarara, ukhalhawaya wo ikekhiaye nhoshungeriya nttuvo nulhupalhe wiirimu. Kwaani ata manyaapwiiya aya aapannge chiicho, waapangelha anamilhohi a Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Nansho nhothapana mwaatti attu o nhakhu va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">ukhalhawaya nhomalha upuha!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Nhothapana mwaatti nnorupalha vano va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwaawolhiya ithalha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Nhothapana mwaatti nnothiaa vano va,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">ukhalhawaya nnoowa mwonlha ni uthuthelha!”<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Nhothapana mwaatti vanototopelhiya inyu ni attu, ukhalhawaya manyaapwiiya aya ahaapangelha chiicho anamilhohi o woothacha.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waattuna amalhaponi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Nansho kinouhimeriani mwaatti nnokiiwa va, mwaattuneke attu anoupangelhani ichimwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />mwaalhapelhelheke ibarakha anoulhavani, mwaalhapelhelheke attu anoupangelhani ichimwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ntu owaatakani nrama ninyu nimoka, munhiyereke owatekeni nikina no nayelhi nno, ntu othurulhakani nikoti ninyu, munhiyereke ni mwiinjiro winyu. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Ntu noovekelhani mummaheke, ntu akushaka nhakhu inyu nhintware wiira ohokolhoshereni. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Chineera inyu wo uthanana wiira mpangelhiye ni attu, mwaapangelheke ni ayo chiicho.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Mwaattunaka attu anouttunani vekha aya, nnohalha chani upochera nnema? Ata attu o uwonya anaattuna attu anaattuna aya! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mwapangaka moombone wa attu anoupangelhani moombone, chani nnohalha upatta chani ibarakha? Ata attu o uwonya aneera chiicho wa attu anaapangelha moombone! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Vavawo mwaashimihaka attu nnokhulhuvelha wiira anouhokolhosherani, nnohalha upatta chani ibarakha? Ata attu o uwonya anaashimiha attu anaahokolhoshera! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Mena! Mwaattuneke amalhaponi inyu ni waapangelha moombone, mwaashimiheke nhikhulhuvelhaka uhokolhosheriya. Vavawo nnoowa mwaapatta nttuvo mwinchi, ni ukhalha ashaana a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe Chinene. Ukhalhawaya ri o uwiiha mpuha wa attu ahichuwenlhe ushukuru ni o unanara mirima. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nkhalheke attu o kiriri thoko Athumwaninyu chiri aya o ikiriri.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waahukumulha attu akina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-6">Mat 7:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Nhaahukumulhe attu akina, Nlhuku khanowa ohukumulhani, nhaakuphulhache attu akina, ni inyu nhiwe mwaakuphulhachiya, mwaahiyerereke attu akina, Nlhuku ohiyererekeni ni inyu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mwaavaheke attu akina, Nlhuku nouvahani ni inyu. Chiicho etu nnoowa mwaapochera wo winchiva chinene, nikaviho mmathathani mwinyu. Maphimelho inyu wa attu, phi maphimelho nnohalha inyu uphimelhiya ni Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Ntu ohoona khanooria unholhelha ntu ohoona nanawe, eeraka chiicho, onkhaye elhi ayo anootumbuchira munlhikitini. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Khaawo owiittucha naapwaha owiittuchiha awe, nansho owiittucha amalhaka wiittucha phi nolhikaana awe ni owittuchiha awe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Nlhatuni etu no woona ikokholha nnithoni mwa nhima inyu uno nhoonaka nipattu niri nnithoni mwinyu mwaanene? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Nnohalha wiira chani wa nhima inyu, ‘Nhima aka nkankani kuuthamihe ikokholha nnithoni mwao,’ nansho nhithamihaka nipattu niri nnithoni mwinyu mwaanene? Mwa anafiki inyu! Nthamiheke thoko nipattu nnithoni mwinyu, vavawo phi nohalha inyu wooria uthamiha ikokholha nnithoni mwa munninyu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwiri ni maphepu aya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:33-35">Mak 12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Mwiri wo ukonda khunemma pufia, mena mwiri wo uhikonda khunemma maphepu oombone. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Mwiri uriwoothe unchuwania wo maphepu unemma aya, khavanooria urukulha ittini munrokani ama urukulha izabibu va mwiri wo miiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ntu o nrima woombone nopanga mitheko choombone chiri munrimani mwawe, ntu o uhilhoka nopanga chittu cho unanara chiri munrimani mwawe. Malhaku anoolhumacha chittu chichanre munrimani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atheki elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Nlhatuni no ukiihana mii, ‘Thithi, Thithi,’ uno nhipangaka thoko chineera aka wo ulheherani? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ntu nokiweelha ni wiiwelhelha malhove aka ni uvarechesha Kinouhimeriani chiri awe. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Nokhalha thoko ntu, notheka inupa awe, athipaka chinene ni utheka nsingi vamwalhani. Mwoolhoko nkawaapaphulha maashi ni ukhita inupa iyo nansho kayaatikhinyelhe, ukhalhawaya yaaholhipihiya vaathekiya aya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Nansho ntu riyoothe neewa malhove aka wo uhivarechesha, nokhalha thoko ntu notheka inupa awe wo uhithipa nsingi vathi, maashi atikhinyeke inupa iyo, yahowulhuwa phiyaru wo nkhito urrrr!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha karumiya a nholhelhi o manyaasikari o Urumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu amalhiheke waahimeria attu yayo malhove onkhaye ayo, nkaarwa iwani yo Ukapenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Nholhelhi o manyaasikari o Urumi ahaana namitheko anttuna aya chinene, yoyo aari nreta chinene amwaatameriaka nookhwa.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Nholhelhi a manyaasikari o Urumi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Nholhelhi uyo veewilhe aya mwaha wa Yesu, nkaaruma ashulhupalhe Ayahudi amwiirelhe awe anlhamiha namitheko awe uyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Nkayaarwaa wa Yesu ni ummenda, ampepechaka wiira, “Yolha ntu ulha hophwanelhiya wiira mwankavihe. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Noottuna ilhapo ihu, tho honikaviha utheka inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Paahi etu Yesu nkaattukana. Vaari awe naatamenrie vawani, nholhelhi uyo nkaaruma attu anhimerie Yesu wiira, “Thithi, mii akiphwanelhiye wiira inyu nkelhe unupani waka, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />phi nlhatu etu akoonrie uwa kimwanene uwiihanani. Mulhumacheke nlhove tu, namitheko aka noolhama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mii kimwanene, ki ntu o ipilhi wa attu akina, kihanaa ikuru yo wemelhelha manyaasikari. Kamwiirelhaka mmoka, ‘Nrweeke!’ Khurwaaka, nkina kamwiirelhaka, ‘Nkaawa va!’ Khuwaaka, kaarumaka anamitheko aka, ‘Mpangeke ilha!’ Khupangaka.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu nkaashanga veewilhe awe nna nlhove nna, nkaarukunuwa ni weerelha attu anttwara ayo, “Kinohimia wiira, akinapacha woona nrima thoko ulha, ata mwiilhaponi mu Israeli mwonkhaye!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Anamitheko nkayaahokolhiacha waarumiye aya ni umphwanya karumiya nreta ulhe nalhamme.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonhihimusha mwaana a anankhwelhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Kaanyuma vakani, Yesu nkaarwa iwani yeehaniya Unaini, aattukanaka vamoka owiittucha awe ni mphingo mulhupalhe wa attu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Vaaphiya awe wowo, nkaakumaana attu aarwaa unvithani ntu. Ntu aakhwilhe uyo aari mwammirawo o yekha wa anumwane, yaari anankhwelhi, avelhelhiyaka ni nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Athithi vonne aya anankhwelhi ayo, nrima waya nkawaakelhiya ihuzuni yo woonelha ikiriri anankhwelhi ayo, nkeerelha, “Nhunlhe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Nkaachushera, nkaapaapelha ikori yaatheshelhiye ntembo uyo, attu aawelhe ayo nkayeemelhacha. Yesu nkeera, “Mmirawo! Kinowiirelha wiira, wunkweke!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mmirawo aakhwilhe uyo nkaakhalha ni uchokholha wulhumacha, Yesu nkanhokolhosha wa anumwane. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Attu onkhaye nkayoovacha chinene, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku, yiiraka, “Namilhohi a Nlhuku mulhupalhe honikhumelhelha! Nlhuku howa uwoopolhani attu awe!” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Yoyo mwaha waapannge awe Yesu uyo, nkawaawanelha ilhapo yo Uyudea yonkhaye ni ilhapo chaatamana aya.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akarumiya ukhuma u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Owiittucha a Nayohana nkayaahimeria Nayohana yoyo mwaha wonkhaye uyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Nayohana etu, nkaaruma owiittucha ya elhi arwee yaakohe Athithi wiira, “Chani inyuva phi alhe aahimiye ni Nayohana wiira, phi nowa ama naaweherereke akina?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Paahi vaaphilhe aya wa Yesu, nkayeera, “Nayohana Obatiiza ahoniruma nuukoheni wiira inyuva phi alhe aaromonlhe aya wiira haawo nowa ama nimmweherereke ntu nkina?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Yesu aari aavahaka attu enchi nnema wo ulhamihiya mareta aya, ikwerere ni mashoka o unanara ni waattukulha miitho attu ohoona. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Nkaakhulha akarumiya a Nayohana wiira, “Nhokolhieke mwaahimerieke Nayohana chittu chonne inyu, attu ohoona anowoona, attu oheeta anoweeta, attu o makutulha anoolhamihiya, attu ohiiwa anowiiwa, attu akhwilhe anoohihimushiya ni attu anokwana anoohimeriya Malhove Orera. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ahoreeriya attu ahiri ni nipampa ni mii!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Owiittucha yaarumiye ni Nayohana vaathamanche aya, Yesu ahochokholha waahimeria attu mwaha unaacha Nayohana, “Vaarwelhe inyu u Nayohana uthakoni ulhe, mwaanyihera wiira nnokowoonani? Nthalhe utikhinyiyaka ni iphioo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Mwaanyihera anoonieke chani? Thoko ntu warenlhe ikuwo chorera? Attu anowara chittu cho nthimicho ni ukhalha apuhaka yayo anokhalhacha uttato! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Nkihimerieke etu, mwaakenlhe woonani? Woona anamilhohi a Nlhuku? Eiyo, nansho nkamwoona chaathempe anamilhohi a Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ukhalhawaya Nayohana phi alhe ahimiye ni Malhove Matakatifu wiira, ‘Nlhuku heera, Kinonruma karumiya aka oholhelheni akooroshe iphiro inyu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu nkeera tho, “Nayohana phi olhupalhe waapwaha attu onkhaye apanche ukhalha velhaponi va. Nansho ntu ri mwankani nhina Imwene ya Nlhuku phi mulhupalhe waapwaha Nayohana Obatiiza.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Attu onkhaye nkayaamwiwa, attu aalhiviha ikhodi nkayaarumelhelhacha ni utotopelha mitheko choombone cha Nlhuku, akhalhaka phi attu yaapochenre ubatiizo u Nayohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Nansho Amafarisayo ni owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ahokhotacha unrumelhelha Nlhuku, ni ukhota ubatiiziya ni Nayohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu nkeera tho, “Vano etu, kinohalha ulhikaaniha ni ittu yaani ilha iyari ilha? Attu aya ari thoko chani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ari thoko ashimirawo aakhalhanche mmapuwani nnopangiya maronda ni wiichiirelha ashineneru, ‘Nahowopelhani ikoma nansho khamwenne! Naheepa ichipo cho nunlhiho nansho khamwonlhilhe!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Nayohana Obatiiza yahowa, ahottuka, khaawunrie idivai, mwaatti nkamweera, ‘Mmwooneke, ri ni nshoka no unanara!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwaana a Ntu nkaawa, nkaalhia ni uwuria, ni mwaattiva nkamweera, ‘Nkamwooneni yolha ntu ulha! Ntu o menyekha ni uhapalhiya, mpwana aya attu anolhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Irusho cha Nlhuku, inakhalhaka chiicho, chinohimiecheshiya wiira cho ikekhia ni attu anrumelhelha.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu vawani va Nasimoni Afarisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Afarisayo yahonlhalhia Yesu wiira alhie yolhia vamoka ni ayo, nkarwaa uwannyaya nkaakhalha ulhia yolhia. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Yeyo iwani iyo ahokhalha opani amoka aapangacha chittu cho uhilhokalhoka. Nkayeewa wiira Yesu aari alhiaka yolhia wa Afarisayo, nkayaakusha ichupa yo malhuku o alabasta yaachanre makhura o unukhelha <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />nkayeemelha amwaatameriaka Yesu uno onlhaka, nkayaammorihelha miithori chaya, vamietoni. Nkayaapoholha ni ikharari mmuruni, nkayaanukhanukha, nkayanhikahika makhura o unukhelha ayo. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Afarisayo ayo vonne aya, nkayeera munrimani mwaya, “Ulha ntu ulha akaari namilhohi, anochuwelha chiri aya alha opani anommarakacha alha, aanachuwelha chiri aya ntu o uwonya!” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu nkoolhumacha eeraka, “Nasimoni, kihanaa nlhove no uhimeriani.” Afarisayo nkayaakhulha, “Aye, Owiittuchiha, nkihimerieke.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu nkeera, “Ahaawo attu elhi yaashimme nchurukhu wa ntu. Mmoka aashimme nchurukhu idinari imia nthanu ni nkina aashimme nhakhu idinari makhumi nthanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Attu ayo voochenlhe aya ulhiva, aheehanacha ni waahiyerera milhatu chaya onkhaye. Paahi etu, wa yayo attu elhi ayo, phuuyi nohalha waattuna chinene attu aashiminhe nchurukhu alhe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Nasimoni nkayaakhulha, “Mii kinoona wiira, ntu aahiyereriye nchurukhu mwinchi ulhe, phi nohalha unttuna chinene yoyo ntu uyo.” Yesu nkeera, “Vavawo nhohukumulha rata.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Nkaarukunuwelha opani alhe nkeerelha Nasimoni, “Nnoowona alha opani alha? Vaawilhe aka unupani winyu, khamwaakivanhe maashi o ukhucha mieto chaka, nansho alha opani alha ahokikhuchiha inyaa ni miithori aya nkayaapoholha ni ikharari chaya. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Khankipochenre rata ni ukibuusu, nansho alha ikatema yonkhaye ari vaa vamoka ni mii. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Khankivanhe makhura o wiihika mmuruni, nansho alha ahokootiha makhura o unukhelha mmietoni. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, uttuna woninhe aya uhaapanga ahiyereriye uwonya waya wonkhaye. Nansho nohiyereriya makani, yoyo nottuna vakani.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu nkeerelha opani alhe, “Nhohiyereriya uwonya winyu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Attu akina yaakhalhanche vayolhiani vawo, nkayoolhumacha ashineneru, “Phi ntu ani yolha, naahiyerera attu o uwonya ulha?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Nansho Yesu nkeerelha opani alhe, “Nrima inyu uhowoopolhani, nrweeke wo mpuha.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Manyopani anttukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Athameke vavawo, Yesu ahorwaa nkwaha wo mmawani ni ittoko ahimiachaka Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku. Akarumiya awe khumi ni elhi yaari anttukanaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Tho, akina yaari manyoopani oomolhelhiye mashoka o unanara ni Yesu ni ulhamihiya mareta aya. Yayo phi anganya Amariamu eehaniya Magidalena, omolhelhiye mashoka saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Nayoana mahanu a Nakuuza attu aapanga ntheko upuwani u Naherode, Asusaana ni manyoopani enchi akina aakumiha nhakhu waya unkavihera Yesu ni owiittucha awe.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no namwaalha imbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mak 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Milhoko cha attu nkachaarwa wa Yesu chikhumaka iwani imoka baada ye ikina. Vaari aya anachanre, Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaaniho nna,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Ahokhalha ntu mmoka aarweelhe uwaalhani imbeyu cho meelhe. Vaalha awe aari amichaka, nkachaakhalha chaamonre vaphironi, nkachaanyikalhachiya na attu, ni ashinuni o wiirimu nkayaalhiacha. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Chikina chaamorenlhe vamwalhani, vaamenlhe aya nkachaanyalha, ukhalhawaya ittaya khayaari ni maashi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Imbeyu chikhwawe chaamorenlhe vaari ittaya yoombone, chahomelha ni utiyelhelhiya ni miiwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Chikina chaamorenlhe vachaayirani chinene, minyepu nkachonnuwa ni uyara meelhe, kila nchashi imbeyu imia imoka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu nkaamalhiha eeraka, “Ri ni maaru eeweke!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulhamulhiya malhikaaniho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mak 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Owiittucha awe nkayankoha Yesu maana o yayo malhikaaniho ayo, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Irusho cho uchuwelha chittu cho Imwene ya Nlhuku nvahiye mwaattiva, nansho attu akina yayo anohalha uchuwelha wo malhikaaniho, vano anooweha nansho khanoona, anowiiwa nansho khanowa aachuwelha.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no ntu o waalha imbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mak 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Maana o nlhikaaniho nno phi wiira, imbeyu phi nlhove na Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Imbeyu chaamonre vaphironi chinooniha attu aneewa, nansho Nakare noowa ni ukusha nttenga uyo mmamirimani mwaya wo waachiichiha wiira ahirumelhelhe ni woopolhiya. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Imbeyu chaamonre vamwalhani chinooniha attu aneewa nttenga ni upochera ateelhiyaka munrimani. Nansho khachinkhalha ni mithithaari nhina mwaya, anorumelhelha wo ikatema ikani, ni ulhikachiya wawaakaru anowulhuwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Imbeyu chaamonre vamiiwani chinokhalha phi attu onkhaye aneewa, nansho nipampa ni nikakata ninowaakelha ni waatiyelhelha wiira ahiyare. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Imbeyu chaamorenlhe vachaayirani chinooniha attu aneewa nttenga ni upochera wo nrima worera, ni ayo khuvilhelhaka mpaka vanoyara aya maphepu oombone.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikhandiri ni ittutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mak 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Attu khanoparihelha ikhandiri ni ukhuneelha ittutu ama weesha nkhwikwichiri. Nansho anothomia vachulhu ikiango, wiira attu yoone nthuko aya uyo amwalheelhiye.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Ittu iriyoothe ivithiye inowa yaawiihiya voonene, ni ittu iriyoothe ikhuneelhiye inowa yaapatakulhiya ni uwiihiya voonene.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Nhiittialhe, mmweheke rata chittu chineewa inyu chiyo, ukhalhawaya attu ari ni ittu anowunchereriya, nansho attu ahirina ittu, ata ikani anaanyihera aya wiira ahanaa iyo inookushiya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anumwanawe ni ashihima awe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Vavawo anumwanawe Yesu vamoka ni ashihima awe nkayaawa, nansho ahoochelha umwaatameria wo nlhatu no uchara attu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ntu mmoka nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Anumwaninyu ni ashihima inyu arii vathe vawo anothanana uwoonani.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu nkeera, “Anumwanaka ni ashilhoko aka ari phi attu onkhaye aneewelhelha malhove a Nlhuku ni uvarechesha.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noomaalhiha iphioo munttiyani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mak 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu ahowelha nkalhavani owiittucha awe nkayanttwara, nkeerelha, “Nngwee nilhapuwe nttiya nirwee ukhopelhelhe.” Paahi etu nkwaha nkawaachokholha. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Mphironi, Yesu ahowolhiya ikhove nkaarupa. Vahipinche, iphioo yo machiri nkayaawuka munttiyani, ikalhava nkayaachokholha uchara maashi, ni attu onkhaye yaari ntatakoni. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Owiittucha nkayanrwelha ummushani, yeeraka, “Owiittuchiha, Owiittuchiha! Niri ntatakoni!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu nkonkwa ni umaalhiha iphioo ni iyo nkayaamaalha, nttiya nkanaakhalha shiriri. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Nkaakoha owiittucha, “Uri vayi nrima inyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Nansho yaari anoomiye uwanoni yoovachaka, yeerelhanaka ashineneru, “Phi ntu ani yolha? Nochachera iphioo ni mawimbi wiira chimaalhe, ni chiyo chinomwiiwelhelha!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowoomolha mashoka o unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mak 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu ni owiittucha awe nkayaaphiya iwani yo Ugerasi, inowehana ni nttiya no Ugalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Vaakhuruwa awe umbwaani, nkankumaana ntu mmoka o mashoka o unanara. Wo iyaakha chinchi, yoyo ntu uyo aari eetaka wo uhiwara ikuwo hikhalhaka uwani, alhokelhaka umahiyeni. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Vaamwonne awe Yesu, nkaakhuwelha, eewulhushaka vamietoni vawe, ni ukhuwelhacha, “Yesu, Mwaana a Nlhuku Mulhupalhe Chinene! Unothanani uwannyaka? Kinoulhepelha wiira, uhikoomolhe!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />olhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya Yesu ahoolhumacha nlhove no ulhehera uthama nshoka nno. Ni nenno nshoka nno naari nimmaraka ikatema chinchi, ata vaattukiya awe mittondoro wiira heetakache aari akwatulhachaka, attawihiyaka ni nshoka no unanara nno wiithuphini.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu nkankoha, “Nchina ninyu apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Nkaakhulha, “Nchina naka ‘Nlhoko,’ ” ukhalhawaya mashoka enchi aari anankenlhe. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mashoka nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira hilhehere oomolhelhiye unaminepa unohalha aya utwarushiya.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Vavawo vakittu vawo vaari vahuwiyaka ikulhuwe, chilhiachaka umwakoni. Paahi mashoka nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira aahiye akelhe nkulhuweni, ni uyo nkaahiyerera. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mashoka nkayankhuma ntu ulhe ni ukelha nkulhuweni. Mphingo wonkhaye wo ikulhuwe nkawaattawelha vathi uhito ni ukelha chititimiraka mmaashini.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Attu yaahuwacha ikulhuwe ayo nkayaattawacha, vonne aya ittu ikhumelhenlhe, ni urwaa uwanelhihani mwaha uyo mmawani ni mmamatani mwonkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Attu nkayaawa yoone chikhumelhenlhe. Vaaphilhe aya wa Yesu, nkayamphwanya ntu aakumihiye mashoka nakhanlhe vamietoni va Yesu, nawanre ikuwo ni irusho chinankhanlhe rata mmuruni, attu onkhaye nkayoovacha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Alhe yonne, nkayaahimiachera akhunanaya chinre awe wo ulhamihiya mashoka wa ntu ulhe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Attu o iwani yo Ugerasi ayo nkayoovacha chinene. Nkayanlhepelha Yesu wiira athame. Paahi etu nkaawelha ikalhava nkaathama. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Ntu aalhamihiye mashoka ulhe ahonlhepelha Yesu wiira, “Ni mii nkittukane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Nansho Yesu nkankhotelha, amwiirelhaka, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Nhokolhieke uwani mwahimieke chipangelhiye inyu ni Nlhuku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ntu uyo nkaavira mmawani ahimiachaka chinre awe wo upangelhiya ni Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abiti Yairo ni nthiyana mmoka anoolhamihiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mak 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu vaahokolhelhe awe ukhopelhelhe nttiya, attu ahompochera, ukhalhawaya aari ammwehereraka. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Paahi ahowa ntu mmoka nchina nawe Yairo, yoyo aari nholhelhi neemelhelha inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku. Nkeewulhusha makukhu anvendaka Yesu wiira anttukane uwannyawe, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ukhalhawaya mwaamwanaya o vekhawe, mwamwalhi o malhipa o iyaakha khumi ni pilhi aari nnookhwani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu vaari awe arwaaka, attu yaari anthothokelhaka uno ni uno. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mmoka aya aari opani amoka aawereiya ireta yo ukhuma iphome, nchorochoro wo iyaakha khumi ni pilhi, amalhihaka nhakhu aya uvira mmireteni, nansho ahilhamaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Nkayanttwara Yesu utulhi, nkayaavara ikuwo awe, iphome nkayaamaalha vavawo vavawo. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu nkaakoha, “Apani akivanre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Kila ntu nkaakhota, ni Napeturo nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha, attu ahourukureriani uno ni uno!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Hawo ntu kivanre, kihochuwelha ukhalhawaya machiri ahokikhuma.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Opani alhe vonne aya wiira khanooria wiivitha, nkayeewiha uno athukhumelhaka ni wiiwulhusha vamietoni va Yesu. Nkayeehimiacha vaattuni vawo, ahimiachaka nlhatu waani wo uvara mwiinjiro ni chinre aya wo ulhama ikwerere aya. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu nkeera, “Mwaamwanaka, nrima ao uhoolhamiha. Urweeke wo mpuha.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu voolhumacha awe chiicho, karumiya aya o weemelhelha inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku nkaawa, nkeerelha, “Mwamwalhi inyu hokhwa, nhaahuvihe tho Owiittuchiha ayo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Nansho Yesu nkeewa, nkeerelha Nayairo, “Nhoove, mpisheke nrima, noolhama.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Vaaphilhe aya vanupani, nkaachiichiha ntu unkelhana mpaani ahikhalhe Napeturo ni Nayohana ni Nayakhobo ni manyanaangoro o mwalhi uyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Kila ntu vavawo aari onlhaka umunlhelha mwalhi uyo. Yesu nkeera, “Umaalhiye uhuunlhiye. Mwalhi ulha kanakhwa, howiraka urupa!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Attu onkhaye nkayanthiacha, ukhalhawaya yaari achuwelhaka wiira hokhwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Nansho Yesu nkammara moono nkeera, “Mwalhi, wunkweke!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Nrima awe nkawanhokolhelha, nkonkwa, Yesu nkaalhehera wiira avahiye yolhia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Manyanaangoro awe yaari anashannge, nansho Yesu nkaalhehera wiira ahinhimerie ntu riyoothe mwaha ukhumelhenlhe.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaaruma owiittucha khumi ni elhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mak 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu nkeehana owiittucha khumi ni elhi alhe, nkaavaha machiri ni ikuru yo woomolha mashoka o unanara ni waalhamiha areta. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Paahi nkaaruma yayo khumi ni elhi ayo avire ahimiachaka Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni waalhamiha areta onkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nkeerelhacha, “Nhikushe ittu iriyoothe munkwahani, nhiwie ikopo mena nrupa mena mashurupu mena nchurukhu, ni mena mmoka inyu hikushe mwiinjiro wo nayelhi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Inupa iriyoothe inohalha inyu upocheriya iyo, mwakhalheke vavawo mpaka vanohalha inyu uthama vawo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Vahinopocheriya uhimiechesha winyu, mwathameke yeyo iwani iyo ni ukukutta ntukurukhu nnyaani wo waamuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Owiittucha nkayaathamacha nkayaarwa mmawani, ahimiachaka Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku ni waalhamiha attu awereiya.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nipampa ni Naherode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mak 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Naherode Amwene o Ugalilaya veewilhe aya chittu chaapangiaa, nkayoova, ukhalhawaya attu akina yeera wiira Nayohana Obatiiza ahohihimmwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Attu akina eera wiira Naeliya ahoonia, akina yiiraka anamilhohi o khalhayi ahohihimmwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Naherode nkayeera, “Nayohana kihaahitha, nansho ulha ntu kinomwiiwaaka ulha phi mpani?” Nkayaathanana umwoona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaalhiha attu maelufu nthanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Akarumiya yahokolhieke, nkayanhimeria Yesu kila ittu yaapannge aya. Nkaakushacha nkayaarwa iwani yo Ubethsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Attu vanchuwenlhe aya, nkayanttwara. Nkaapochera, nkoolhumacha mwaha wo Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni waalhamiha mareta yaarina aya.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Nchuwa veelha aya, akarumiya khumi ni elhi nkayanrweelha ni unhimeria wiira, “Mwaahiyeke attu ayo ahokolhiacheke uwannyaya ni uvira yaaviaka yolhia mmawani ni mmamatani, yaavie yolhia ni mapuro o urupa, ukhalhawaya vari ihu va vauthakoni.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Mwaavaheke yolhia mwaattiva.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Nkayaakhulha, “Ittu nirina ihu iri mikatte nthanu ni ihopa pilhi. Chani nirweeke nathumeke yolhia yo waavaha attu onkhaye alha?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Attu yaari vavawo aari alhopwana maelufu nthanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Mwaakhalhiheke attu vathi milhoko cha attu makhumi nthanu kila nimoka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Owiittucha yamalheke waakhalhiha attu mmapuroni, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu nkaakusha mikatte nthanu ni ihopa pilhi, nkaaweha wiirimu, nkalhapelhelha ibarakha, nkaamianihacha, nkaavaha owiittucha yaakawelhe attu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Attu onkhaye nkayaalhia, nkayaawonacha, ni owiittucha nkayaarokottacha mahalhahalha aahanlhe, nkayaachariha ni ukusha makaya khumi ni melhi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napeturo anonhimiechesha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mak 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari alhapelhaka vekha awe, owiittucha nkayaawacha, nkaakohacha, “Ana attu aneera mii phi mpani?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Nkayaakhulhacha yiiraka, “Akina aneera, Nayohana Obatiiza, akina aneera Naeliya, ni akina aneera inyuva mmoka a anamilhohi o khalhayi hihimmwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Nkaakoha, “Ni inyu mwaatti chani, nneera mii phi mpani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Inyuva phi Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonhimiacha nookhwa awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mak 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Paahi Yesu nkaachiichiha wiira ahinhimiachere ntu riyoothe yoyo mwaha uyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Nkaahimeria tho, “Mwaana a Ntu nowa utwarushiya ni ukhotiya ni ashulhupalhe ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero. Noowa eeviya nansho nihuku no neraru nowa uhihimmwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Nkeerelha attu onkhaye, “Ntu riyoothe nothanana ukittwara eeruneke mwanene, akusheke nsalaaba awe kila nihuku akittwareke, <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe nothanana woopolha ukumi awe, noopoteriha, nansho ntu riyoothe noriha ukumi awe wo nlhatu waka nowa woopolha. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ntu nohalha upattani wo upatta mpuha wonkhaye wo velhaponi va, nansho apoterihaka ukumi awe mwanene? Mena khiiwo! <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ntu oonaka ishoni wo nlhatu naka ni meettuchiho aka, Mwaana a Ntu ni uyo nowa umwoonelha ishoni vanohalha awe uwa wo nthimicho wa Athithi ni minepa chitakatifu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Kinoohimeriani ikekhia wiira, ahawo akina vaa ahinowa aakhwa ahinaya woona Imwene ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorukunuwa ikhove</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mak 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Yavireke ijuma imoka toka voolhumanche awe yayo malhove ayo, Yesu nkaakusha Napeturo ni Nayohana ni Nayakhobo nkayaarwaa umwaakoni ulhapelhani. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Vaari aya alhapelhachaka, ikhove awe nkayaarukunuwa, ni ikuwo chawe nkachaateelha chinene. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Nkoonia attu elhi amwaarerihanaka Yesu, ni ayo yaari ashinna Musa ni Naeliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />aakhumelhenlhe wo nthimicho, nkaamwaarerihana mwaha wo umalhiha ntheko wa Nlhuku nnookhwani ukhumelhelha Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Napeturo ni akhunanaya yaari anarumpe, yeyo ikatema nkayonkwa ni woona nthimicho wa Yesu ni attu elhi emenlhe vamoka ni uyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Attu elhi ayo vaathama aya wa Yesu, Napeturo nkeera, “Owiittuchiha, ihorera hii ukhalha vaa! Ninootheka etu mahema mararu, nimoka nawinyu nikina na ashinna Musa ni nikina ni Naeliya.” We ikekhiaye khayaari achuwelhaka inoolhumacha aya.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Napeturo voolhumacha aya, nihute nkanaakhuruwa ni waakhuneelha, vaawa aya owiittucha alhe yaari yoovaka chinene. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Nlhove nkaneewiya ukhuma wiirimu neeraka, “Ulha phi Mwaamwanaka, kinonttuna aka, mmwiiwelhelheke yoyo!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Nlhove vaamaanlhe aya, Yesu aari vekha awe. Owiittucha nkayaamaalha wo unhihimeria ntu riyoothe yoyo mwaha uyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowoomolha mashoka o unanara ammanre mwammirawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mak 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Waashelhe waya Yesu ni owiittucha araru ahokhuruwa umwaakoni, ni nlhoko mwinchi wa attu nkawankumaana Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Vavawo, ntu mmoka nkaakhuwelha, “Owiittuchiha! Kinoulhepelhani chonte mummwehe mwanaka, mwanaka o yekha awe! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nshoka ninonkelhakelha, khummulhushaka venchi, khukumaka niphoru mmwano, khunhuvihachaka chinene wo uhinhiya! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Kahaalhepelha owiittucha inyu wiira oomolhe nshoka nno, nansho khayonrie.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaatti iyari ihiri ni nrima, iwonnye va! Kinohalha ulhokelha ni uvilhelhani mpaka iyaakhani?” Nkeerelha athumwanawe mwaana ayo, “Mummwiiheke mwaamwaninyu uyo vaa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mwaana vaawihiya awe, nshoka no unanara nkanammulhusha vathi ni unhelha ichilhichilhi. Yesu nkaachachera nshoka nno, mwaana nkaalhama, nkanhokolhosha wa athumwanawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Attu onkhaye nkayoomiya uwanoni woona ikuru chulhupalhe cha Nlhuku.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu nonhimiacha tho nookhwa awe.</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mak 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Attu yaari ashangaka chittu chonkhaye chaapangiye ni Yesu, venre awe wo owiittucha awe, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mwiiwelhelheke alha kinohalha aka uhimeriani! Mwaana a Ntu nokelha uhelhiya mmathathani mwa attu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Nansho owiittucha khayaachuwenlhe yaahimia awe, ukhalhawaya yaari inavithiye uwannyaya. Nkayoova unkoha maana aya.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpani ri mulhupalhe aya?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-4">Mat 18:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mak 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Nkawaachokholha ukohaniya owiittucha ashineneru wiira phi mpani ri mulhupalhe aya. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu nkaachuwelha choopuwelha aya munrimani, paahi etu nkankusha mwanhima, nkaamweemesha vaari aya, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />nkeera, “Ntu riyoothe nompochera mwanhima thoko ulha wo nchina naka nokipochera mii, ni ntu nokipochera mii, naapochera akirumilhe. Ukhalhawaya ri mwankani waapwaha onkhaye munlhokoni mwinyu, yoyo phi mulhupalhe inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hinoovengani yoyo ri vamoka ni inyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mak 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Nayohana nkayoolhumacha, “Owiittuchiha, nahomwoona ntu oomolhaka mashoka wo nchina ninyu, nkananchiichiha, ukhalhawaya khari nyu ninonttukana ihu vamoka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhichiichihe, ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe hinoovengani yoyo ri vamoka ni inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwani ya Asamariya inonkhota Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ikatema vaatamenrie aya ukushiya Yesu wiirimu, nkoona mbaya arwee Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Nkaaruma akarumiya anholhelhe, arwee Usamariya akooroshe vakittu vanohalha awe uphiyelha. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Nansho anenchi o Usamariya ahokhota umpochera ukhalhawaya aari alhukamaka Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Paahi etu owiittucha Nayakhobo ni Nayohana vonne aya chiicho, nkayeera, “Thithi, chani niihaniheke mooro wo wiirimu naamalhihe yalha?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu nkaarukunuwa ni waachachera. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Paahi Yesu nkaathama mwanene vamoka ni owiittucha awe nkayaarwaa iwani ikina.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aphwanelhiye ukhalha owiittucha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Vaari aya munkwahani, ntu mmoka nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Kinouttwarani uriwoothe unohalha inyu urwaa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu nkaamwaakhulha, “Anancheto ahana milhiwi ni ashinuni o uchulhu urimu ahanaa iphuuru chaya nansho Mwaana a Ntu kharina nipuro no waathalhelha muru awe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Nkaamwirelha ntu nkhwawe, “Nkittware.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Nansho ntu ulhe nkeera, “Thithi, nkihiye thoko kirwee kaavithe athumwanaka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu nkaakhulha, nkeerelha, “Mwaahiyeke attu akhwilhe yaavitheke attu aya khwilhe. Inyu nrweeke mwahimiacheke Imwene ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Ntu nkina nkeera, “Thithi kinouttwarani, nansho nkihiye thoko kalhehe uwani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu nkeera, “Ntu riyoothe nolhima uno awehaka utulhi, yoyo khanooria ittu nhina Imwene ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaaruma akarumiya makhumi saba ni elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Yamalheke yayo, Athithi nkayaathanlha akina makhumi saba ni elhi, nkaaruma elhielhi arwee aholhelhe kila iwani ni kila vakittu vaathanana awe urwaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nkeerelhacha, “Nlhaalha uri mwinchi, nansho anamitheko o ukhungura ari vakani. Nlhepelheke etu anene nlhaalha yaawihe anamitheko oowa ukhungurani cholhia chaya. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nrweeke etu! Kinourumani mwaattiva thoko ikhondoro umiichini. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nhikushe nchako wo nchurukhu mena nrupa mena iratu, nhinkohache ntu riyoothe mphironi. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Vanophiya inyu vawani, nchokholheke wo wiira, ‘Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu,’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Akhalhaka haawo ntu noopocherani mwommo, nhiyeke mpuha inyu vavawo, aahikhalheke, nhokolhosheke mpuha inyu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mwakhalheke vavawo, mwalhieke ni uwuria ittu iriyoothe nnohalha inyu uvahiya, ukhalhawaya namitheko hophwanelhiya malhivo. Nhikelhe mwaakukuriacha uno ni uno. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Mwaphiyaka vawani mpocheriyaka, nlhieke yolhia nterekhelhiye inyu iyo, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />mwaalhamiheke areta ni waahimeria attu o wowo wiira, ‘Imwene ya Nlhuku ihaatameria.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Nansho mwaphiyaka vawani vahinopocheriya inyu, nthameke, ni vanovira inyu mmaphironi mwaya mweereke, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Ata ntukurukhu no vawani winyu ninivanre nnyani nno, ninookukutta vano wooniha wiira nihouhiyerani mwaashinene! Nansho nchuwelheke wiira, Imwene ya Nlhuku ihaatameria.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, Nihuku no uhukumulhiya attu nno, inowa ukhalha ittu yo waalhuwa chinene wo iwani yo Usodoma uvilhelha ntwarusho upwaha yeyo iwani iyo!”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uthapana iwani chihinorumelhelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Nhothapana inyu iwani yo Ukorazini! Nhothapana iwani yo Ubethsaida! Ukhalhawaya cho ushangiha chipangiye uwaninyu chikaapangiye Utiro ni Usidoni, attu yammwara majuniya ni wuupuruwa vaatuurani wooniha wiira ahokhoroma uhiya uwonya waya! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Nansho nihuku no ihukumu nno, inowa ukhalha ittu yo waalhuwa wo iwani cho Utiro ni Usidoni wooria uvilhelha ntwarusho naya upwahani mwaattiva. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ni inyu Nakapenaumu! Chani nnothanana wiiwelhiha mwaanene wiirimu? Nnoowa mwaawulhusheriya unaminepa!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Ntu riyoothe nowiiwelhelhani, hokiiwelhelha mii, ntu riyoothe nookhottani nokikhota mii, ni ntu nokikhota mii naakhota akirumme.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhokolhia makhumi saba ni elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Makhumi saba ni elhi aarumiye alhe nkayaahokolhia, yaari anateelhiye chinene yeeraka, “Thithi, ata mashoka ahoniiwa vaaromonlhe ihu nchina ninyu!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kahomwoona Nakare awulhuwaka thoko uverunya ukhuma wiirimu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mwiiweke etu! Kihohuvahani ikuru, yo unyikalha inwaa ni makharang'andha ni ikuru yo unnyikalha mmalhaponi inyu ulhe, ihikhalhaka ittu cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nansho nhiteelhiye ukhalhawaya nshoka nihowiiwani, nansho nteelhiyeke ukhalhawaya machina inyu aholhepiya wiirimu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nooteelhiya nrima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, Yesu ahoteelhiya wo ikuru yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku nkeera, “Thithi, Athithi o wiirimu ni o velhaponi! Kinoushukuruni ukhalhawaya nhaavitha attu o irusho ulha mwaha ulha, nkamwaapatakulhelha akani. Aye, Thithi, phinre aya wo uchivelhani.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Nkeera tho, “Athithi ahokivaha chittu chonkhaye. Khaawo nchuwenlhe Mwaana ahikhalhe Athithi ni khaawo aachuwenlhe Athithi ihikhalhe Mwaana ni attu athanlhiye ni Mwaana wiira aapatakulhelhe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yesu nkaarukunuwelha owiittucha awe nkaahimeria wo nivitho, “Nhoreeriya mwaatti ukhalhawaya miitho inyu ahoona chi chittu chinoona inyu chi! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, anamilhohi a Nlhuku ni mamwene enchi yahothanana alha anoona inyu alha, ahoone ni wiiwa, nansho khayoonne, ahottuna wiiwa thoko mwaattiva nansho khayeewilhe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no Nsamariya orera nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Owiittuchiha Malhehero rata nkayaawa ni unkoha Yesu wo unlhikacha. “Owittuchiha, kipangekeni kipatte ukumi wo uhimalha?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Malhehero alhepiye chani? Nnoshomani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yoyo ntu uyo nkaakhulha, “Munttuneke Nlhuku inyu wo nrima inyu wonkhaye ni nnepa inyu wonkhaye ni machiri inyu onkhaye ni irusho chinyu chonkhaye ni waattuna amwaatamana inyu thoko chineettuna inyu mwaanene.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhaakhulha rata. Mpangeke etu ni ukhalha thoko chiicho.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Nansho ochuwelha Malhehero rata ayo nkayaathanana wiichooniha wiira aari ntu o nrima woombone, paahi ahonkoha Yesu, “Amwaatamana aka phi apani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu mmoka aari alhukamaka Uyeriko akhumaka Uyerusalemu. Nkaavariya ni attu o uvara makhuche, nkayanrulha ikuwo, nkayanthurulha nhakhu awe nkayaamwata chinene, nkaahiya nakomweelhe. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Opochera ishaani amoka nkayaavira vavawo, nansho vaamwonne aya khayanlhohilhe, nkayaavira uchereshere. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Chiichammo, Nlawi mmoka nkaaphiya vavawo, nkaamwona nkaavira uchereshere. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Nansho Nsamariya mmoka eeta munkwahani ahophiya vavawo, vaamwonne awe ahomwonelha ikiriri. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Nkaamwaatameria, nkanhapiha makhwata, nkanhika makhura ni idivai ni unttukelha. Amalheke nkammwelhiha vachulhu iphuta awe, nkanrweha inupa ya alheto ammwerehe. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Washeeke, nkaakumiha nchurukhu wo malhivo o mahuku melhi ummaha mwanene inupa ni umwiirelha, ‘Mummwereheke ntu ulha, ni ittu inohalha wunchereria kinoowa kaalhiva vanohalha aka uhokolhia.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Paahi Yesu nkaakoha, “Wo irusho chinyu inyuva, wo yayo attu araru ayo, phi mpani aari namwaatamana e ikekhiaye a ntu aatakachiye ni attu o uvara makhuche ulhe?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ochuwelha Malhehero rata alhe nkayaakhulha, “Aari ntu amwonenlhe ikiriri ulhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu nkeera, “Ni inyu etu nrweeke, mwapangeke thoko chiicho.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu uwani u Namatha ni Amariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu ni owiittucha awe vaari aya munkwahani, yahophiya iwani yaapocherie awe uwani wa opani amoka eehaniya Namatha. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Yayo yaari ni arokoraya eehaniya Amariamu, aakhanlhe vathi vamietoni va Athithi ni wiiwelhelha meettuchiho aya. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Namatha nkayaathunalha woona wiira aapanga vekha aya ntheko wo waaterekhelha alheto, nkayaarwaa ni wiira, “Thithi, woonaka khannoona wiira arokoraka ayo ahokihiyera ntheko vekha aka? Mweerelheke aweeke aakikaviha!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Namatha, Namatha! Nnothemwani. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ittu imoka tu phi renre. Amariamu ahothanlha ittu yoombone ihinooria uthurulhiya ni ntu riyoothe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowiittuchiha ulhepelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari alhapelhaka vo vekha awe. Amalhiheke, owiittucha awe mmoka nkaamwirelha, “Thithi, nniittuchiheke ni hii ulhepelha, thoko chinre aya Nayohana wo weettuchiha owiittucha aya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Vanolhapelha inyu mwiireke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Athithi nri wiirimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Nchina ninyu nithimichiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">imwene inyu iwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Nnivaheke yolhia ihu kila nihuku.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Nnihiyerereke uwonya wihu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">thoko nineera ihu wo waahiyerera anittekenlhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Nnoopolhe muulhikachiyani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu nkeerelhacha tho owiittucha awe, “Ikhalhe wiira mmoka inyu norwaa wa ampwana awe uhiyu variyari ni uhimia wiira, ‘Mpwana, nkaashimihe mikatte miraru, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />alheto ahokiphwanya ampwana aka ari munkwahani, ni mii akirina ittu yo waavaha!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ni ayo anari mpaani nkayaakhulha, ‘Nthame uwo nhikihuvihe mii! Kihottia nlhako, mii ni achishaana aka nihokelha mpaani urupani. Paahi akinonkwa kiwe kouvahani ittu iriyoothe.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Inohalha wiiria chani etu? Kinouhimeriani ikekhia wiira khanoonkwa uwaavahani nkatte wo nlhatu no umpwana waarina aya, mena, nansho wo nlhatu no waanyakulha ni uthepa uvekelha, phi chiichammo chinohalha aya wunkwa ni waavaha ittu inovekelha aya.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Paahi etu, Nvekelheke nnoovahiya, mwaavieke nnoopatta, nhodisheke vankhorani nnoohulhelhiya. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe novekelha noovahiya, ni ntu naavia noopatta, ni ntu nohodisha vankhorani noohulhelhiya. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Chani mwaana vanovekelha awe ihopa wa anaangoro awe, novahiya inwaa kuhiwe ihopa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ama novahiya nikharang'andha vanovekelha awe nnyoche? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Inakhalhaka nri attu o unanara mirima nansho nhochuwelha chittu choombone cho waavaha achishaana inyu. Chani etu, athumwaninyu o wiirimu khanouvahani chittu choombone wo upwaha, anowaavaha Iphumu ya Nlhuku attu anaavekelha!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Belzebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mak 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu aari omolhaka nshoka no unanara nantunke ntu huulhumache. Paahi etu vankhumme aya, ntu ulhe ahooria wulhumacha tho, mpaka nlhoko wa attu nkawoomiya uwanoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Nansho attu akina nkayeera, “Noomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo Belzebuli, nholhelhi o mashoka o unanara, phi nommaha ikuru yo woomolha.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Attu akina yaari athananaka unria Yesu, paahi nkayamwiirelha wiira apange cho ushangiha cho wiirimu oonihe wiira Nlhuku ri vamoka ni uyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha choopuwelha aya, nkeera, “Imwene iriyoothe imianelhe yaatakanaka ineeneru yeyo khinolhokelha chinene, chiicho iwani imianelhe yaatakanaka ineneru inowulhuwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Paahi yakhalhaka etu imwene yo Nakare iheemianiha yaatakanaka ineeneru, inohalha ulhokelha chani? Mwaatti nneera wiira eti kinoomolha mashoka wo uvahiya ikuru ni Belzebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Yakhalhaka kinoomolha mashoka wo ikuru yo Belzebuli, owiittucha inyu etu anoomolha wo ikuru ya apani? Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu ashaana inyu mwaashinene phi nowa uhukumulhani mwaatti. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Nansho yakhalhaka kinoomolha mashoka wo ikuru ya Nlhuku, nchuwelheke wiira Imwene ya Nlhuku ihomalha uphiya uwaninyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Ntu o machiri vanolhitelhelha awe inupa awe ni ikerero, inupa ni nhakhu awe chinoolhama. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Nansho awaaka ntu o machiri chinene o mpwaha ni umwaata ni ummulhusha, yoyo nookusha ikerero chaakhulhuvelha awe chiyo ni umwaakha nhakhu.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Ntu riyoothe hiri vamoka ni mii, yoyo nookivinga, hinokhungura vamoka ni mii yoyo phi noomwarusha.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhokolhia nshoka no unanara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Nshoka no unanara vanoomolhiya aya mwiiruttuni mwa ntu, nivovira neetakachaka uhiri maashi naaviaka nipuro no wiittuwa. Naahooneke, vavawo phi neera aya, ‘Kinoohokolhia unupani waka.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Paahi noohokolhia ni uphwanya inupa mwaari inakwechiye ni urerihiya. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Paahi tho, phi norwaa aya ni waakusha mashoka makina saba o uhilhoka umphwaha uyo, ni uwa uukhalhani vamoka ni uyo. Vanomalha aya, ntu uyo nokhalha muuhuvani chinene upwaha khalhayi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpuha we ikekhiaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu voolhumacha awe, opani amoka nkayeera, “Ahopuha athiyana uyanreni ni uwaamwiihani!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Nansho Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nansho areeriye chinene, phi ayo aneewa nlhove na Nlhuku ni uvarechesha!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvekelhiya cho ushangiha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Nlhoko wa attu voonchereria aya, Yesu nkeera tho, “Ilha iyari ilha iri yo uhilhoka ilha! Inovekelha woona cho ushangiha, nansho khinoonihiya yo ushangiha iriyoothe ihikhalhe i Nayona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Chiichammo etu Nayona chenre aya wo waashangiha attu o Uninavi, phi chiichammo Mwaana a Ntu chinohalha awe waashangiha attu o ilha iyari ilha. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Nihuku no uhukumulhiya attu nno, Ahano o Usheeba anowa weemelha ni waahukumulha attu e ilha iyari ilha, ukhalhawaya ahovira toka utayi awe eewelhelha irusho chi Naselemani, ni mii kinohimia wiira vaa haawo Yesu, ntu mulhupalhe naapwaha Naselemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Nihuku no uhukumulhiya attu, attu o Uninavi anowa weemelha waahukumulha attu o ilha iyari ilha wiira ahowonya. Ukhalhawaya attu o Uninavi ahokhoroma veewilhe aya meettuchiho a Nayona, nansho vaa hawo mulhupalhe naapwaha Nayona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nthuko wo iruttu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Khaawo ntu noparihelha ikhandiri awe ni ukhuneelha ittutu, nansho nothomia vachulhu ikiango wiira yaamwalhelhe attu anokelha mpaani. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Miitho inyu phi nthuko wo iruttu. Miitho inyu akhalhaka makumi, iruttu yonkhaye inokhalha voonene, nansho miitho awereiyaka iruttu yonkhaye inokhalha yo unanara, inokhalha mwiipiphini. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Mwiiraniheke etu, nthuko uri nhina mwinyu uhikhalhe ipiphi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Paahi etu, iruttu inyu yonkhaye yakhalhaka voonene, wo uhikhalha mwiipiphini, iruttu inokhalha voonene thoko vanomwalhelhiya aya ni nthuko.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaakuphulhacha Amafarisayo ni owiittuchiha Malhehero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu amalhihekeru wulhumacha, Afarisayo amoka ahomwiirelha arwee alhie yolhia uwannyawe. Nkaarwa ulhiani yolhia, nkaakhalha ulhia. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Afarisayo ayo nkayaashanga woona wiira Yesu aari alhiaka wo uhinyawa mathatha rata. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Paahi Athithi nkayeera, “Mwaatti Amafarisayo va, nnohapiha ikahi ni iphache wo vatheru, nansho nhina ncharaka chittu cho nanrokotolhe chihinlhoka. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Nhophupuwalha inyu ayi! Nlhuku phi kooronshe vathe ni nhina chiicho. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Nansho mwaavaheke attu ahirina chittu chiri nhina, ni chikina chonkhaye chiyo chinookhalha chorera uwaninyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Nhothapana inyu Mwaamafarisayo va! Ukhalhawaya nnaahukumulha ni waalhiviha attu isadaka yo nifungu no khumi ata yo mathaakhuru o uhelhiya mmathapani, nchicha ni mathaakhuru makina, nansho nhilhohaka mwaha wo uvarechesha ikekhiaye ni uttuna wa Nlhuku. Yayo yaaphwanelhiye wooniya wiira nhovarechesha rata nhilhiyalhaka makina ayo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Nhothapana inyu Mwaamafarisayo va! Mwaatti nnottuna ukhalha miholho mapuro o nthimicho wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ni ukohachiya wo nthimicho vanopangiya maronda. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Nhothapana inyu! Mwaatti nri thoko mahiye o uhichuwania, attu aneeta aya vachulhu waya ahichuwelhaka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa amoka nkayaamwiirelha, “Owiittuchiha, venre inyu chiicho, nhoniruwana!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nhothapana ni inyu Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa va! Nnaaria attu misigo cho ulhemelha, nansho mwaanene nhookolhaka nikokho nhaakavihaka ukusha chechiyo misigo chiyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Nhothapana inyu! Ukhalhawaya nnoovaka mahiye a anamilhohi a Nlhuku eevakachiye ni manyaapwiinyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Paahi etu nnohimiechesha ni uvarechesha mitheko cho manyaapwiiya inyu, ukhalhawaya yayo phi evilhe anamilhohi ni inyu vano nnoovaka mahiye aya. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Wo nenno nlhove nno etu, irusho cha Nlhuku chineera, ‘Kinowaarweehelha anamilhohi ni akarumiya, anokoweeva akina ni waatwarushacha akina.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Paahi etu attu o ilha iyari ilha anowa utwarushachiya wo weeva anamilhohi a Nlhuku onkhaye toka voopiye aya ilhapo, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />toka wiiviya wa Nahabilu mpaka wiiviya u Nazakariya, yeeviye variyari madhubahu ni Inupa Itakatifu. Eiyo, kinouhimeriani wiira, attu a ilha iyari ilha anowa utwarushiya wo mitheko chaya!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Nhothapana inyu owiittuchiha Malhehero! Ukhalhawaya nhokusha mittukulho cho nlhako wo inupa yo irusho, mwaanene nhikelhaka, mwaachiichihaka attu anlhikacha ukelha wowo!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Vaathama awe, Amafarisayo alhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachokholha unchopeyacha chinene wo unkohakoha chookohiya chinchi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />alhikachaka unria wiira ammare wo malhove awe.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Waamukiya attu aneepanga unchuwelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Attu maelufu menchi vaathukhumana aya vamoka, anyikalhanachaka ashineneru, Yesu nkeerelhacha owiittucha awe thoko, “Mwiichinanelheke ni ihengedure ya Amafarisayo, yaani unafiki waya. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kila ittu ivithiye inowa uhumbukulhiya ni kila ittu ivithiye inowa yaapatakulhiya. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Paahi etu, kila ittu yuulhumachilhe inyu mwiipiphini, inowa yeewania voonene, ni ittu yaapilhe inyu nlhako unatteiye, inowa yaahimiachiya vanchaarani.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpani nooviya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Kinouhimeriani, manyampwana aka, nhoove attu aneeva iruttu nansho ahooriaka ittu ikina iriyoothe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Kinowoonihani vano etu, mpani o umwoova. Mmwooveke Nlhuku, nooria wiiva, amalhaka wiiva, hanaa ikuru yo unrihelha ntu umooroni Ujehannamu. Nkirumelhelheke mii, yoyo phi vekha awe o wooviya!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Chani, athooche athanu khanthumihiya wo isenti pilhi? Nansho Nlhuku khanonlhiyalha ata mmoka. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Wo ikekhiaye, ata ikharari chinyu cho mmuruni chihaalhakelhiya chonkhaye. Nhoove etu, mwaatti nri o ukhulhuvelhiya chinene waapwaha athooche enchi va!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unrumelhelha ni unruna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, kila ntu norumelhelha vaattuni wiira phi awaka, Mwaana a Ntu ni uyo noowa aarumelhelha wo minepa cha Nlhuku wiira phi awawe. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Nansho attu onkhaye anokikhotta vaattuni, Mwaana a Ntu nowa ni uyo nowa unkhota wo minepa cha Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Ntu riyoothe noolhumacha nlhove no unvinga Mwaana a Ntu nowa uhiyereriya, nansho attu anohalha wulhumacha malhove o nlhava Iphumu ya Nlhuku, khanowa aahiyereriya.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Vanohalha aya uweemeshani mu inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ama wa ahoolhelhi ama wo attu o ikuru yo utawara, nhikelhiye nipampa wiira nnohalha wulhumachani wiira mwaakhulhe. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowa owiittuchihani yeyo ikatema iyo nlhove naani no wulhumacha.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho na ntu o nhakhu o uphupuwalha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Ntu mmoka o nhakhu mwaattuni mmo nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha, mmwiirelheke nhima aka wiira nikawane nhakhu nihiyeriye ihu na athumwanihu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu nkaamwaakhulha, “Mpwana, mpani kivanhe mii ntheko wo uhukumulhani ama ukawaniha nhakhu inyu mwaatti elhi va?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nkaathepa waahimeria attu onkhaye eeraka, “Mwiichinanelheke ni iphiro chonkhaye cho nlhulha, ukhalhawaya ukumi wa ntu khumpangiaa ni chittu chirinawe ama wo nhakhu urinawe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria nlhikaaniho nna, “Ahaawo ntu mmoka o nhakhu wo imata yaaruweria awe chinene. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nkaakhalha oopuwelhaka mwaneneru, ‘Akirina nikhupi no uthokoreria cholhia chaka. Kiireke chani etu?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Nkeecheerelha, ‘Kinoophomolha ichikuti chaka ni utheka nikhupi nulhupalhe chinene, ninohalha aka uthokoreria cholhia ni chittu chaka chonkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Vavawo phi nohalha aka wiira, Nhoreeriya! Nhanaa vano akhiba yo chittu chonkhaye chaathemwelha inyu iyaakha chinchi chinene. Mwiittuweke etu vano, nlhieke, mmwurieke ni ulhia mpuha ene!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Nansho Nlhuku nkaamwirelha, ‘Nhophupuwalha inyu! Ulha uhiyu wo lhelho ulha, ukumi inyu phi noweiya aya, ni nhakhu wonkhaye nshungilhe inyu unohalha ukhalha wa apani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu nkaamalhiha eeraka, “Phiri aya chiicho wa ntu neecheshera nhakhu awe mwanene, uhikhalhaka nhakhu unomphwanelha Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munrumelhelheke Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Mwaatti kinouhimeriani wiira, nhikelhiye nipampa no mwaha wo yolhia wiira nlhame ama ikuwo cho uwara mwiiruttuni mwinyu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ukumi phi renre upwaha yolhia ni iruttu upwaha ikuwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mwooneke anakhuku, khanaalha imbeyu ama ukhungura vanlhaalhani, kharina ichikuti mena nikhupi, Nlhuku phi naalhiha! Ni inyu mwaatti nri o ukhulhuvelhiya waapwaha ashinuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Mpani munlhokoni mwinyu wo ukhalha ni nipampa, nowooria wuncherera ukumi awe vakani? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Paahi etu, yakhalhaka wiira khannooria ata vakani upanga ittu thoko yeyo, nipampa ne ishiyani etu? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mwooneke ituva chineera aya wookonda, khachirina ntheko mena khachinotiva. Nansho kinouhimeriani wiira ata Amwene Naselemani anene ayo, ni mpuha waya wonkhaye khayaawanre ikuwo yo nthimicho thoko imoka aya ituva chi. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Yakhalhaka etu Nlhuku phi nokondiha chiicho mathaakhuru o mmatani ari lhelho ahaawo, meelho ahorihiya vamooroni, chani khanoria uwarihani mwaatti wo upwaha? Mwaatti chani woonaka mirima chinyu chiri chikani!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Paahi etu nhikelhiye nipampa, nhuvihiyaka ni chittu cho ulhia ni uwuria. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ukhalhawaya chechiyo chittu chonkhaye chiyo chinohuvelhiya velhaponi va ni attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku. Athumwaninyu o wiirimu ahochuwelha chittu chonkhaye nnothanana inyu chiyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nansho mwaatti nchenjeukelheke thoko Imwene ya Nlhuku, ni inyu nnoowa mwaavahiya ni wuncherereriya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhakhu wiirimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Nhoove, inyu mwaatti nri nlhoko mwankani wa owiittucha aka, Athumwaninyu o wiirimu ahochivelhiya uuvahani mwaatti Imwene. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Nthumiheke nhakhu inyu ni waavaha nchurukhu uyo amashikini. Nkoorosheke mirupa chihinthaalha, ni wiishungera nhakhu wiirimu uhinowukuwa aya. Wowo, attu o wiiya khaneeiya mena nrenje khunolhia. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Vanohalha ukhalha nhakhu inyu, nrima inyu unohalha ukhalha vavawo.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akarumiya o ukhulhuvelhiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Nhiittialhe, nkhaalheke rata, ni ikhandiri chinyu chikhalheke tayari, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />thoko anamitheko anaaweherera anene ntheko ahokolhie ukhuma u arusini, awe aahulhelha vanohalha aya wiihana vankhorani. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ahoreeriya yayo anamitheko ayo, anohalha uphwanyiya ni anene ntheko ashelhelhihaka! Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, anowa urulha nikoti naya, ni waakhalhiha wiira aaterekhelhache. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Areeriye chani yayo anamitheko ayo anohalha uphwanyiya ashelhelhihaka inakhalhaka uhiyu veriyari ama mapikoosha! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Nchuwelheke wiira, anene inupa akaachuwenlhe ikatema o wiiya vanowa aya, khaarupa, anshelhelhiha alhitelhelhaka inupa aya ihiphomolhiye. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho, nhittialhe, ukhalhawaya Mwaana a Ntu nowaa ikatema ihinaanyihera inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akarumiya o ukhulhuvelhiya ni o uhikhulhuvelhiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Napeturo nkayeera, “Thithi, nna nlhikaaniho nna nawihu vekha ama ni attu akina chiicho?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Paahi etu, phi karumiya ani nokhulhuvelhiya o irusho? Phi yoyo novahiya ipilhi, weemelhelha ni waalhiha anamitheko nanawe waayakaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Horeeriya yoyo karumiya uyo vanophwanyiya awe ni anene ntheko apangaka chiicho vanohokolhia aya uwani! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ikekhiaye nowa ummaha ntheko mulhupalhe wo weemelhelha nhakhu aya wonkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Nansho, karumiya uyo echiirelhaka munrimani mwaneneru wiira anene ntheko khanohokolhia chitema, nkaachokholha waatakacha anamitheko akhunanawe, ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana alhiaka ni uhapalhiya, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />anene ntheko phi nohokolhia aya chitema nihuku nihinaanyihera awe ni ikatema ihichuwenlhe awe. Anene ntheko anowa untwarusha ni unkakhelha wa attu ahinonrumelhelha Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Karumiya nochuwelha mathananelho a anene ntheko, nansho hiicheshaka rata, nowaatiya chinene. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Nansho karumiya nopanga wo uhichuwelha nowa utwarushiya vakani. Vahiye chinchi nowa ukohiya chinchi, vahiye chinchi chinene nowa ukohiya chinchi chinene.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowamwalhaaniha attu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Kiwilhe uparihelha mooro velhaponi, ukaari unapharenlhee! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Kihanaa ubatiizo wo utwarushiya ukiphwanenlhe, kinthemwa chani wiira utimire! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Nnaanyihera kiwanne mpuha velhaponi va? Mena, akiwanne mpuha, kiwanne umwalhaana. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Uchokholha vano nna, iwani ya attu athanu inomwalhaana, attu araru wa attu elhi ni elhi wa araru. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Manyanaangoro ashilhopwana avenganaka ni achishaana aya ashilhopwana, ni ashaana ashilhopwana aavengaka ashithumwanaya, manyanaangoro athiyana aavengaka ashaana aya ashithiyana, ni ashaana ashithiyana aavengaka manyanaangoro, ahokohi aavengaka ashihokohi aya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uchuwelha ikatema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu nkaahimeria tho attu, “Vanoona inyu nihute nikhumaka uneelha nchuwa, mwaatti nneera, ipulha inoorupa lhelho, ni iyo khurupaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Vanoona inyu iphioo iwukaka uchawa, nneera, ntukutta ninoopaha lhelho, khuupahakani. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwa anafiki inyu! Nhochuwelha uweha vathi ni wiirimu ni uhukumulha ittu yaani inohalha ukhumelhelha, nnoochelha chani etu uchuwelha maana o ikatema chi?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmwiiwananeke mmalhaponi inyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Chani woonaka khannooria wiihukumulha ittu yorera yo upanga? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ukhalhawaya ntu munttekenlhe inyu orwehakani umilhatuni, iri mbaya umwiiwanana nnari mphironi nhinaphiya, huurweeheni wa ahoolhelhi anohukumulha milhatu, ni inyu nkamwaattukiya wa attu anaatuka attu, nhelhiyaka njeerani. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ikekhiaye khannowa mwaakhuma wowo mpaka nhomalha ulhiva isenti yo umalhihera nlhatu winyu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nhiyeke uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, nkayaawa attu akina ni umwiirelha Yesu mwaha wa attu o Ugalilaya yeevakachiye ni Napilato ni iphome aya nkayaathakanihiya ni isadaka yaakumihiya wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani nnaanyihera wiira yayo attu ayo aari o uwonya waapwaha Agalilaya akina, wo wowo uttwaruwa uwo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Mena! Ni mii kinouhimeriani wiira, mwaahikhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu, nnookhwacha onkhaye thoko chinre aya. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ama attu khumi ni nane yaawulhuwelhiye ishanja Usiloamu ulhe nkayaakhwa, yaari attu o uwonya waapwaha attu yaakhalha Uyerusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Mena! Kinouhimeriani wiira, mwaahikhoromeke ni uhiya uwonya winyu, ni inyu nnookhwa chiicho.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no ntiini wo uhimma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Ahaawo ntu mmoka aalhilhe mwiri wo ntini umatani waanlhe awe izabibu. Nkaawa uuwehani kila iyaakha oone wiira uhemma athomolhe, nansho wo uhiphwanya ittu. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nkaamwiirelha ntu aashunga imata uyo, ‘Nkoonani! Iyaakha ttaaru chonkhaye chi kihowa va wo uhiphwanya ittu ata mena. Vano etu nkakheke mwiri uyo! Weeshiyani uthepa ulhia ittaya wo uhikhalha maana?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Nansho ntu aalhita imata uyo nkaakhulha, ‘Nkahiyani pwiiya, ukhalhe iyaakha imoka ilha, kinookhureria ni uhelha ichaayira. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Mwaahiino wemmaka aye, waahimmeke, vavawo etu mmweeke mwaakakha.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha nthiyana Nihuku no Wiittuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Nihuku no Wiittuwa nimoka Yesu aari eettuchihaka wi inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Vavawo ahokhalha oopani amoka awereiya mashoka o unanara iyaakha choomalhaka khumi ni nane, iruttu aya yaari inaremanre ahookokwaka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu vonne awe, nkeehana ni weerelha, “Amma, nholhamihiya ikwerere inyu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Nkeeshera moono awe, ni yeyo ikatema, iruttu aya nkayookwaa tho, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Nansho olhupalhe emelhelha inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku ahorushiya chinene woona wiira Yesu honlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Paahi etu, nkayeerelha attu, “Arii mahuku sita o upanga ntheko, mmweeke yayo mahuku ayo mmwe mwaalhamihiya, nansho kuhiwe Nihuku no Wiittuwa!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Mwa anafiki inyu! Mpani mmoka inyu hinonthaphulha mwannama awe ama iphuta awe nhiilhini wiira awurihe maashi Nihuku no Wiittuwa? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Vano etu, vaa haawo ulha mwaana a Aburahimu aremarihiye ni Nakare iyaakha khumi ni nane ulha. Chani khireenre wiira athaphulhiye Nihuku no Wiittuwa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Paahi nlhove naakhunlhe awe, nkanoolhiha muru attu anvenga ayo, nansho attu akina onkhaye aari anateelhiye mirima wo woona chittu cho nthimicho chaapangelhe.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no imbeyu yo iharadali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mak 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu nkaakoha, “Imwene ya Nlhuku inolhikaanani? Kilhikaaniheke ni ishiyani? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Inolhikaana thoko choo. Ntu aawelhe imbeyu ikaani chinene yo iharadali nkaalha umatani wawe. Nnyepu nkawonnuwa ukhalha mwiri mulhupalhe, ashinuni o uchulhu wiirimu nkayaathekacha iphuuru chaya mmarittani mwaya mmo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no ihengedure</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu nkaakoha tho, “Kilhikaanihekeni ni Imwene ya Nlhuku? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Thoko, opani amoka aawelhe ihengedure nkoothuwaniha iphepa madebe melhi ni ntikha nkayaarurummwa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhako wo yevayeva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu nkaarwa miholho nkwaha awe wo Uyerusalemu aviraka mmawani ni nttokoni mwonkhaye, eettuchihaka attu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Ntu mmoka nkankoha eeraka, “Thithi, chani attu vakani phi nohalha ulhama?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu nkaakhulha, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mwiikayeke uvira nlhako wo uyevayeva, ukhalhawaya attu enchi anoolhikacha uvira nansho ahooriaka. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Anoowa mahuku anene inupa vanohalha aya uttia nkhora, ni inyu mwaatti mweemelhaka vathe mwiihanaka mwiiraka, ‘Pwiiya, nnihulhelhe.’ Nansho yayo anowa uwaakhulhani, ‘Akuuchuwenlheni mwaattiva!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ni inyu nnoowa mwaakhulha, ‘Hii phi alhe naalhia ni uwuria vamoka ni inyu, nkamweenittuchiha uwanihu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ayo anowa wiira vavawo tho, ‘Kinre wiira akuuchuwenlheni mwaatti. Nthamache va, inyu mwaatti o uwonya va!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Phi nohalha aya ukhalha nunlhiho ni ukhura miino, vanohalha inyu woona Aburahimu ni Naisaka ni Nayakhobo ni anamilhohi onkhaye nhina Imwene ya Nlhuku, nansho mwaatti nkamwaakhotiya! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Attu anoowa ukhuma unosha nchuwa ni akina uneelha nchuwa, uchulhu ni uchawa ni ukhalha ukaraamuni Imwene ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Eiyo, wo ikekhiaye ahanlhe utulhi anowa ukhalha o uholhelha, ni ayo aholhenlhe vano ayo anowa ukhalha o umalhihera.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uttuna wa Yesu iwani yo Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, Amafarisayo akina nkayaawa wa Yesu ni umwiirelha, “Nthame vaa nrwee vakittu vakina, ukhalhawaya Naherode anothanana uwiivani.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu nkaamwaakhulha eeraka, “Nrweeke mwaahimerieke anancheto ayo, ‘Kinoomolha mashoka o unanara ni waalhamiha areta lhelho ni meelho, nihuku no neraru kinomalhiha ntheko aka.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, lhelho, meelho ni nroto kiri munkwahani mwaka, khavanlhoka namilhohi wiiviya uriwoothe ihikhalhe Uyerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Iwani yo Uyerusalemu, iwani yo Uyerusalemu! Nneeva anamilhohi, nnaata malhuku akarumiya arumiye ni Nlhuku! Vachani kilhikanche aka waathothokaniha achishaana inyu, thoko nankutu chineera awe wo wooramelha achishaana awe mmapuphani mwawe, nansho khamwaattunne. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Haya etu, iwani inyu inoophomolhiya. Kinouhimeriani wiira, khannokoona mpaka vanohalha inyu wiira, ‘Atotopelhiye uyo nowa wo nchina na Athithi uyo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha nreta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Nihuku no Wiittuwa nimoka, Yesu ahorwaa ulhia yolhia uwani wa Afarisayo ahoolhelhi, ni attu aari vavawo yaari ammwehawehaka. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ntu mmoka eepilhe mieto ni miono nkaawa wa Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu nkaakoha owiittuchiha malhehero ni Amafarisayo, “Chani, Malhehero ihu anonivaha ikuru yo upanga cho urera unlhamiha nreta Nihuku no Wiittuwa ama uhipanga?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Nansho khayaakhunlhe nlhove. Yesu nkankusha ntu uyo, nkanlhamiha, ni unhiya ahokolhie uwani. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Paahi nkeerelha attu ayo, “Mpani munlhokoni mwinyu mwaamwanawe ama iphuta awe yatumbuchiraka munlhikitini, hinorwaa ni unkumiha inakhalhaka niri Nihuku no Wiittuwa?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Attu ayo khayoonrie umwaakhulha ittu.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nrima woombone ni wiitimarikha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu nkoona attu akina alhalheiye cheera aya wo uthanlha ihiche choombone, nkeerelha nna nlhikaaniho nna, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Ntu olhalhiakani u arusini, nhikhalhe mapuro o nthimicho, hiwe nlheto nothimichiya uupwahani inyuva. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Vavawo ntu olhalhelheni mwaattiva onkhaye, nowa uwiirelhani, ‘Nthameke mwaaviriheke alha.’ Phi vavawo vanowa inyu wuulhihiya muru vaattuni ni urwaa uukhalhani utulhi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Nansho, mwalhalheiyaka nrweeke, mwaphiyaka mwakhalheke utulhi, anenchi inyu ayo owihanekeni, eereke, ‘Mpwana uweeke waakhalha uholho unouno.’ Vavawo nnowa mwaapatta nthimicho vaattuni va alheto onkhaye vawo. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ukhalhawaya ntu riyoothe neewelhiha, nookurushiya, ni ntu neekurusha noowelhihiya.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Paahi Yesu nkeerelha anenchi awe ayo, “Mwaaterekhelhaka attu yolhia, uthana ama uhiyu, nhaalhalhie ashilhoko inyu ama manyampwana inyu ama attu o nhakhu, ukhalhawaya ni ayo anowa uulhalhiani, nkayolhivani. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Vanoterekha inyu yolhia ya ikaramu, mweehanacheke ashikini, attu o uremara, attu o makutulha ni attu ohoona, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />vavawo nnooreeriya, ukhalhawaya yayo kharina ittu yo ulhivani. Nlhuku phi nohalha uulhivani nihuku na attu orera nrima vanowa aya uhihimushiya nnookhwani.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no ikaramu yulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ntu mmoka aari nakhanlhe vavawo veewilhe awe, nkaamwirelha Yesu, “Ahoreeriya yayo attu anohalha ukhalha ukaraamuni alhiaka wi Imwene ya Nlhuku ayo!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu mmoka ahoterekha ikaramu yulhupalhe yeehanne awe attu enchi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Vaayilhe aya, nkaamwiirelha karumiya awe arwee ehanache alheto, ‘Mmweeke vano mwaatti, ikaramu ihaaya!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Nansho onkhaye khayaawilhe, kila mmoka ahimiaka nlhatu ni urwaa unthekoni wawe, o upacha alhepelhaka eeraka, ‘Nkakihiyeni kirwee kawehe imata kithumme aka, nkihiye etu kirwee wowo.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Nkhwawe uyo aholhepelha ni wiira, ‘Kihothuma ing'ope khumi cho ulhima elhi elhi ni vaa kiri munkwahani ulhikachani, nkakihiyeni kirwee wowo.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nkina nkeera, ‘Kithenlhe naanano, paahi etu akinowa.’” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Karumiya nkaahokolhia ni waahimeria anrumme. Anene ntheko nkayaarushiya chinene nkaamwirelha karumiya uyo, ‘Waakuvieke urweeke mmaphironi ni mmawani, mweehaneke amashikini ni attu oremara ni attu ohoona ni attu oheeta.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Karumiya nkaahokolhia nkeera, ‘Thithi, malhehero inyu ahopangia, nansho attu khari enchi khanachara.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Anene nkayamwiirelha karumiya tho, ‘Urweeke etu vano mmaphironi ni nchereshere mmo, waakhupeke attu awaacheke awe aachariha inupa. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, khaawo ata ntu mmoka kinlhalhelhe aka nohalha ulhawiha yolhia iterekhiye ukaraamuni waka va!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iphiro yo ukhalha owiittucha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Vavawo milhoko minchi cha attu chaari chinttwaraka Yesu, nkaarukunuwa ni weerelha, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Ntu riyoothe nowa uwannyaka, ahikittuneke mii ni waavenga athumwanawe ama anumwanawe ni ahanu awe ni achishaana awe ni ashihima awe ni ashirokorawe ata ni ukumi awe mwanene, khanooria ukhalha owiittucha aka. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Ntu hinokusha nsalaaba awe ni ukittwara khanooria ukhalha owiittucha aka.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Ntu mmoka inyu athananaka utheka ishanja, nochokholha ukhalha thoko vathi aalhakelhe nhakhu unthananiya, oone wiira nowooria yoyo ntheko uyo. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Aahikhalhaneke, khanooria upanga ata ntheko wo utheka nsingi, ni attu onkhaye anowa unthiaa, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />yiiraka, ‘Yolha ntu ulha ahochokholha rata, nansho hoochelha umalhiha!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Ama mwene ani nothanana waatakana ikhoto ni mwene nkina hinokhalha nipuro ni wuupuwelha thoko. Noopuwelha wiira, chani manyaasikari elufu khumi arina awe anowooria waatakana ikhoto ni amwene akina? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Oonaka wiira khanooria, phi naaruma awe attu o urweeha nttenga wo mpuha wo wiiwanana ni yoyo mwene uyo ahinakumaana. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Chiichammo etu, khaawo ata mmoka inyu nokhalha owiittucha aka aahihiyereke kila ittu rina awe.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maakha othuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mak 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Maakha ari o uchiva, nansho athuwaka, anohalha uchivihani? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Khanlhoka tho nttayani mena ukhalha ichaayira, anokhalha o rihiya. Ri ni maaru eeweke!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ikhondoro yoopotera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Nihuku nimoka attu o ulhiviha ikhodi ni attu o uwonya enchi yahowa umwiiwelhelhani Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Amafarisayo ni owiittuchiha Malhehero nkayaachokholha utukutuwacha, “Mmwooneke yolha ntu ulha! Naapochera attu o uwonya ni waalhiana yolhia!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria nna nlhikaanihero nna,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ntu ri ni ikhondoro imia imoka, oonaka imoka ihopotera, neera chani? Noohiya chikina makhumi tisa ni tisa chiyo wiithuphini, ni urwaa uuthothani imoka ipotenre iyo mpaka oone. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Oonakaru, khuchishaka vanikhathani <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ni uhokolhia attapelhelhaka. Khweehanaka manyampwana awe ni amwatamana eeraka, ‘Nittapelhelheke etu mwaatti, ikhondoro yaapotenre ihoonia!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Chiicho kinouhimeriani wiira, phi nohalha aya uttapelhelhiya wiirimu ntu mmoka o uwonya vanokhoroma awe ni uhiya uwonya, waapwaha akina makhumi tisa ni tisa ahinovarechesha ikekhia.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nikhobilhi nipotenre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Ama nnoona chani, opani amoka ari ni makhobilhi khumi, naapoteraka nimoka anohalha wiira chani? Anooparihelha ikhandiri ni ukwecha inupa aaviaka rata mpaka oone. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Vanoona aya, phi neehana aya manyampwana aya ni amwaatamana vamoka, eeraka, ‘Mwaatti, nkanngwe nittapelhelhe nikhobilhi naakipotenre nihoonia!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Chiichammo etu, kinouhimeriani wiira, minepa cha Nlhuku phi neera aya wo uttapelhelha ntu mmoka o uwonya vanokhoroma awe.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaana aapotenre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu nkaathepa waahimeria eeraka, “Ahaawo ntu aari ni ashaana elhi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Mwankani uyo nkeerelha athumwane, ‘Athumwanaka, nkivahe nhakhu unkiphwanelha.’ Nkaakawelhachiya elhi ayo. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Avireke mahuku vakani, nkaathumiha nhakhu awe ni urwaa nkwaha wo utayi ni ihera chonkhaye chaarina awe. Wowo nkaakhalha ni ulhia chonkhaye pufia. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Vaamalhinhe awe kila ittu, nkawaakhumelhelha ikuruna, nkaachokholha uthemwathemwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Nkaarwa upangani ntheko wa ntu mmoka nnenchi o yeyo ilhapo iyo, anrweehilhe umatani wawe alhihe ikulhuwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Nkaathanana ata ukhura makova aalhiya ni ikulhuwe, ukhalhawaya khaawo ntu anlhoha. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Voopuwenlhe awe, nkeera, ‘Wa athumwanaka, anamitheko enchi anoolhia ni urupalha, ni mii uno kikhwaaka ithalha! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Kinoohokolhia etu uwani wa athumwanaka keerelhe, Athumwanaka, kihowonya irimu ni uwaninyu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Akinophwanelhiya wiihaniya mwaamwaninyu, nkipangeke thoko mmoka a anamitheko inyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Paahi etu nkaachokholha nkwaha wo uhokolhia uwani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Nari utayi, athumwanawe nkaamwona, nrima nkawaakelha ikiriri, nkayaattimakacha, nkayampochera ni unkumbatira mwaamwanaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwaamwanaya nkeera, ‘Athumwanaka, kihowonya wa Nlhuku wiirimu ni uwaninyu. Akiphwanelhiyaka tho wiihaniya mwaamwaninyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Nansho athumwanawe nkeehana akarumiya aya, eeraka, ‘Mwaakuvieke, nkawaani! Mmwiiheke ikuwo choombone chiyo, mmwe mwammwariha. Mummwariheke ni pete nnikokhoni ni iratu mmietoni mwawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mwamalhaka nrweeke mwanhitheke mwang'ope o uneneva uyo, nittapelhelhe! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ukhalhawaya mwaamwanaka ulha ahokhwa nansho vano ri nkumi, ahopotera, nansho vano hoonia.’ Nkayaachokholha uttapelhelha.”<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Yeyo ikatema iyo, mwaana mulhupalhe uyo aari umatani. Vaahokolhia aya, aatameriaka vawani, nkayeewa ikoma choopiyaka attu eenaka. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Paahi etu nkaamwiihana karumiya mmoka ni unkoha, ‘Ana urini?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Karumiya nkaakhulha eeraka, ‘Nhima inyu hohokolhia uwani, ni athumwaninyu ahonhithelha mwang'ope o uneneva ulhe, ukhalhawaya ahompatta nari nkumi.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Mmirawo mulhupalhe uyo nkaathunalha chinene nkaakhota ukelha mpaani, athumwane nkayaawa ni umpepecha wiira akelhe mpaani. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Nansho uyo nkaakhulha, ‘Nkoonani thithi, iyaakha chonkhaye chi kinovara ntheko uukavihani thoko ipotta, mena akinawonya malheheriyo inyu. Nkivanheni? Khannakivaha ata mwaapuri wiira kiipuhihe ni manyampwana aka! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Nansho ulha mwamwaninyu ulha, holhia pufia nhakhu wonkhaye ni ashithiyana o ulhavalhava, ni vano vahokolhelhe awe, nhonhithelha mwang'ope o uneneva!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Athumwanawe nkayaakhulha, ‘Mwaamwanaka, uri ulhokelhaka ni mii, ni kila ittu iri yawawo. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Nansho ninttapelhelha ukhalhawaya nhima inyu ahokhwa, nansho vano ri nkumi, ahopotera nansho vano hoonia.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Akarani o woothacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Ahaawo ntu o nhakhu aari ni akarani o ipilhi yo weemelhelha nhakhu awe. Nkaahimeriya wiira akarani ayo aari alhiaka pufia nhakhu awe uyo. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Paahi nkeehana ni weerelha, ‘Urini anaa, malhove kineewa aka alha? Nkaalhakelheke etu nhakhu aka, ukhalhawaya khanrina tho ipilhi yo ukhalha akarani aka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Akarani nkayeechiirelha aneneru, ‘Anene ntheko alha ankelha ukithurulha ipilhi aka. Kiireke chani vano etu? Akooriaka ulhima, koonaka ishoni unlhepelha ntu. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Aye, kihochuwelha cho wiira! Vanohalha aka uhiihiya ipilhi aka munthekoni vawo, kinowa kaapatta manyampwana o kipochera mii mmanupani mwaya.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Paahi nkeehana attu onkhaye aashimihiye nchurukhu ni anene ntheko. Nkaakoha o upacha, ‘Ana mwaashimme nchurukhu nchani?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nkaakhulha, ‘Mapipa imia o makhura o uto, maalhakelhiyo ayo alha vaa.’ Akarani nkayeera, ‘Nkhalheke nlhepeke wiira yaari makhumi nthanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Nkankoha nkina, ‘Haya ni inyu mwaashimme nchani?’ Nkaakhulha, ‘Kaashimme mirupa imia imoka cho ngaano. Maalhakelhiyo ayo phi alha vaa.’ Nkeerelhiya ni uyo, ‘Nlhepeke wiira yaari mirupa makhumi nane.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Paahi etu, anene ntheko ayo nkayaapuhiha yayo akarani o ipilhi o uhilhoka ayo wo irusho chaarina aya. Ukhalhawaya attu o velhaponi ari o upenya waapwaha attu o nthuko.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu nkoolhumacha tho, “Ni mii kinowiirelhani wiira, mpangeke umpwana ni nhakhu wo mwiilhaponi, vanohalha aya umalha vawo, mmwe mwaapocheriya mu nihema no mahuku o uhimalha.” Vavawo nkeerelha, “Mwaatti nneepanga orera nrima mwaattuni, nansho Nlhuku achuwelhaka mirima chinyu. Ukhalhawaya ittu inoonia uteelha waattuni, Nlhuku noona wiira phiri yo uhilhoka. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ntu riyoothe nokhulhuvelhiya wo makani nowa ukhulhuvelhiya wo chittu chuulhupalhe, ntu hinokhulhuvelhiya wo makani, khanowa aakhulhuvelhiya wo chittu chulhupalhe. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Mwaahirumelhelhiyeke wo chittu cho mwiilhaponi, nnohalha ukhulhuvelhiya chani etu wo nhakhu we ikekhiaye? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Vavawo mwaahiphwanelheke munhakhuni mwa ntu nkina, mpani etu nohalha uuvahani ittu?”<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Khaawo namitheko nooria waatumikelha ashinene ntheko elhi, apangaka chiicho, nowa unvenga mmoka ni unttuna akina ama nookhulhuvelhiya wa ntu mmoka ni uhikhulhuvelhiya wa ntu nkina. Khannoria ukaviha ntheko wa Nlhuku ni nhakhu vamoka.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhikaaniho makina a Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mak 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Amafarisayo veewilhe aya chaahimiya ni Yesu, nkaayaathunalhacha wo nlhatu no uttuna nchurukhu chinene. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Mwaatti phi inyu nneepanga attu o nrima woombone mwaattuni, nansho Nlhuku achuwelhaka uwonya winyu. Ukhalhawaya chittu chinoonia wiira phi chorera mwaattuni chechiyo phi cho uhilhoka wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni malhove alhepiye ni anamilhohi chaari chihimiyaka mpaka ikatema i Nayohana Obatiiza, ukhuma vavawo, Malhove Orera o Imwene ya Nlhuku phi nohimiachiya, ni kila ntu akelhaka wo machiri. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Nansho vari vowaalhuwa irimu ni ilhapo uvira, upwaha inakhalhaka nlhove nimoka nilhepiye no Malhehero ufutiya.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Ntu riyoothe naavaha mahanu awe italaka ni waathelha athiyana akina, holhavalhava, ni ntu naathelha opani ayo, ni uyo holhuva.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntu o nhakhu ni Nalazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Ahaawo ntu mmoka o nhakhu aawara ikuwo cho nchurukhu mwinchi cho thereria ni ukhalha mumpuhani mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ni vavawo ahokhalha tho ntu nshikini eehaniya Lazaro, aari ni makhwata iruttu yonkhaye, aawiihiya kila nihuku vankhorani va ntu o nhakhu ulhe, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />wiira arokotte cholhia chaamoramora vamezani va ntu o nhakhu ulhe. Ni ashipwa ahowa ni unlhathacha makhwata awe.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Nshikini ulhe, nkaakhwa, nkaakushiya ni minepa o wiirimu ukhalhihiyani vamoka ni Aburahimu. Ntu o nhakhu ni uyo nkaakhwa, nkaavithiya. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Unaminepa nkaakhalha muuttwaruwani chinene, nkaapathusha miitho nkoona Aburahimu anakhanlhe utayi vamoka ni Nalazaro. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Paahi etu nkeehana, ‘Apwiiya Aburahimu! Nkoonelhe ikiriri, mwaarume Nalazaro inakhalhaka apaphe nikokho naya mmaashini, awe aatipiha nlhimi naka nna, ukhalhawaya mooro unookipaha chinene!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Nansho Aburahimu nkayaakhulha, ‘Muupuwelheke anaka, wiira vaari inyu akumi valhe mwaari muupuhani chinene, Nalazaro ahuvaka. Nansho vano uno ari mumpuhani, ni inyu nhuvaka. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, variyari ihu hii ni inyu mwaatti, vari nlhikiti nulhupalhe, khavanooria ntu uwa uno ni attu o uno uwa wowo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Ntu aari o nhakhu ulhe nkeera, ‘Kinolhepelha etu pwiiya wiira, mwaarume Nalazaro ayo arwee uwannyaka wa athumwanaka, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ukhalhawaya ahohalha ashihima aka athanu, arwee aamukache, ni ayo ahiwe aaphiyelha nna nipuro no ntwarusho nna.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Aburahimu nkayeera, ‘Ashihima inyu ahana malhove alhepiye a ashinna Musa ni anamilhohi akina o waamuka, eewelhelheke yayo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ntu o nhakhu ulhe nkaakhulha, ‘Yeyo vekha aya khinthosha, pwiiya Aburahimu! Nansho ntu akaahihimmwe ni urwaa wowo, vavawo anokhoroma ahiyaka uwonya waya.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Nansho Aburahimu nkayeera, ‘Yaahiiweke malhove a ashinna Musa ni anamilhohi, khanowa aarumelhelha attu ariyoothe anakhalhaka ahihimmwe nnookhwani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Uwonya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mak 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu nkaahimiachera owiittucha awe wiira, “Chittu chinaahelha attu mu uwonyani lazima chikhumelhelhe, nansho hothapana ntu naawonyiha attu akina! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ikaari mbaya yoyo ntu uyo akaattukelhelhiye nshilho nshikoni ni urihelhiya ubaharini kuliko ummwonyiha mmoka aya alha ashinkani alha. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Paahi etu mwiichinanelheke!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Nhima inyu awonyaka, munchachereke, akhoromaka munlhevelhelheke. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ottekelhakani imara saba wo nihuku nimoka, ni kila ikatema awaaka ni wiira, ‘kihokhoroma,’ munlhevelhelheke.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhalha ni nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Akarumiya nkayeerelha Athithi, “Nnuncherereke nrima.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Athithi nkayaakhulha, “Mwakaari ni nrima wo upisha inakhalhaka mwankani thoko imbeyu yo iharadali, mwaneerelha ulha mwiri wo nkhuyu ulha, ‘Mwiikhulhe mwaanene mweephateelhe ubaharini!’ ni uyo waanowiiwani.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntheko wa akarumiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Niire wiira mmoka inyu hanaa karumiya nonlhimelha ama noshunga ikhondoro chawe. Chani vanohokolhia awe umatani, noomwiirelha, waakuvieke, ukhalheke, ulhieke yolhia? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Mena! Nomwiirelha, ‘Ukiterekhelhe yolhia mii thoko, mwiichesheke rata ni ukitumikelha mii vanolhia aka ni uwuria vawo, wamalhaka uterekheke yawao.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Chani aterekhaka nonttuna yoyo karumiya uyo wo ntheko ulheheriye awe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ni inyu mwaatti chiicho, mwapangaka ntheko ulheheriye inyu, mwiireke, ‘Hii niri akarumiya o uhikhulhuvelhiya, nihopanga tu thoko chilheeheriye ihu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaalhamiha attu khumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu vaarwaa awe Uyerusalemu, ahovira mmwiinanoni mwo Usamariya ni Ugalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Vaaphiya awe iwani imoka, nkaakumaana attu khumi o makutulha eemenlhe utayi <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />akhuwelhachaka, “Yesu! Thithi! Nnoonelhe ikiriri!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu vonne awe nkeera, “Nrweeke mweechooniheke wa opochera ishaani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Vaari aya mphironi arwaachaka, nkayaalhamacha. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Mmoka vonne awe wiira holhama, nkaahokolhia, anthimichaka Nlhuku wo nlhove nulhupalhe. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Nkeewulhusha vathi oopuruwaka vamietoni va Yesu ni unshukuru. Yoyo ntu uyo aari Nsamariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu nkeera, “Yaari attu khumi alhamihiye, akina tisa ayo ari vayi etu? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Chani woonaka ulha nlheto ulha vekha awe phi wilhe unthimichani Nlhuku?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Paahi Yesu nkaamwirelha ntu uyo, “Munkweke nrweeke, nrima inyu uhoolhamihani.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa Imwene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Amafarisayo akina nkayankoha Yesu Imwene ya Nlhuku inohalha uwa iyaakhani. Aakhunlhe eeraka, “Imwene ya Nlhuku khinowa thoko chinaanyihera inyu. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Khaawo ntu nohalha wiira, ‘Alha va!’ Ama wiira, ‘Irii valhe!’, ukhalhawaya Imwene ya Nlhuku iri nhina mwinyu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Paahi nkaahimeria owiittucha awe, “Ikatema inoowa vanohalha inyu wunlhelha woona ikatema yo Mwaana a Ntu, nansho nhoonaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ahawo anohalha uwa uwiirelhani, ‘Nkoonani, rii valhe!’ Ama ‘Nkoonani rii vaa!’ Nansho mwaatti nhirwee ummwehani. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ukhalhawaya thoko chineera aya wo uverunya uno ni uno wiirimu, phi chiichammo Mwaana a Ntu chinohalha awe wiira nenno nihuku nno. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />nansho ahinaya yayo mahuku ayo, hophwanelhiya uhuva chinene ni ukhotiya ni attu o ilha iyari ilha. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Thoko chaari aya ikatema ya Anuhu, phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku no Mwaana a Ntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Attu yaari alhiaka ni uwuria, athelhaka ni uthelhiya, mpaka nihuku Anuhu vaawelha aya isafina. Igarika nkayaawa nkayeevakacha attu onkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Inottuna ukhalha thoko mahuku a Nalutu. Attu yaari alhiaka awuriaka, athumihaka ni uthuma aalhaka imbeyu ni utheka manupa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Nihuku Nalutu vaathama aya Usodoma, malhuku o mooro nkaarupa thoko ipulha ukhuma wiirimu ni weevakacha attu onkhaye. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Phi nohalha aya ukhalha nihuku Mwaana a Ntu vanohalha awe upatakulhiya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Nenno nihuku nno, ntu riyoothe nohalha uphwanyiya vanchaarani hikhuruwe vathi uwa ukusha nhakhu awe, chiicho ntu riyoothe nohalha uphwanyiya utimani hihokolhie uwani. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Moopuwelheke ahanu a Nalutu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Ntu nothanana woopolha ukumi awe noopoteriha, ntu nokumiha ukumi awe nowa woopolha. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Yoyo uhiyu uyo, Kinouhimeriani wiira, attu elhi anowa urupa vamoka, mmoka nowa ukushiya, nkina ahiiyaka utulhi. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Manyopani elhi anowa ushilha meelhe vamoka, amoka anowa ukushiya akina ahiiyaka utulhi. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Attu elhi anowa ulhima mmatani vamoka, amoka anowa ukushiya akina ahiiyaka.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Owiittucha nkayankoha Yesu, “Thithi, vayi wowo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vakittu variwoothe vari ntembo, phi vakittu vanothukumanacha marepo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho ni anankhwelhi ni Ohukumulha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Paahi, Yesu nkaahimiachera nlhikaaniho no weettuchiha wiira ikatema yonkhaye anthananiya akhalhe anlhapelhaka Nlhuku wo uhoocha ntu. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nkeera, “Iwani i naneshe ahaawo ntu o uhukumulha mmoka hanthimicha Nlhuku mena waalhoha attu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ni wowo ahokhalha anankhwelhi amoka aawa kila ikatema uulhepelhani wiira aakaviheriy apatte ittu yaahuvelha aya, eeraka, ‘Nkikavihere kipatte ikekhia inohuvelha aka ukhuma wa mmalhaponi aka!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Wo mahuku menchi ntu o uhukumulha uyo aari akhotaka, nansho wo umalhihera nkeera mwaaneneru munrimani mwawe, ‘Inakhalhaka akimoovaka Nlhuku ama waalhoha attu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />nansho wo nlhatu wo uhuvihiya chinene ni anankhwelhi alha, kinowenkelha ikekhia aya. Kaahiireke chiicho anoothepa ukinyoonyiha, ni ukoocheeha!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Athithi nkayaathepa wulhumacha, “Paahi mwiiweke etu, chenre aya wo wulhumacha yayo o uhukumulha o uhilhoka ayo. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Chani etu, Nlhuku khanowa aalhakelhaka ikekhia attu athanlhiye, anomunlhelha kila nihuku uthana ni uhiyu? Chani noocherewa waavaha inonlhelha aya? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, nowaavaha ikekhia wo uhicherewa. Nansho chani, Mwaana a Ntu nowa aaphwanya attu o nrima vanohalha awe uwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho na Amafarisayo ni attu o ulhiviha ikhodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu nkaahimiacha tho nna nlhikaaniho nna wa attu eecherumelhelha woona urera nrima ni waaveehacha attu akina. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Ahaawo attu elhi aarweelhe u Inupa ya Nlhuku uulhapelhani, amoka yaari Afarisayo, ni akina yaari olhiviha ikhodi.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Afarisayo nkeemelha vachereshere vo vekha aya, nkaalhapelha munrimani, ‘Kinoushukuru Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya akirii thoko akina o uhilhoka, akihiwe ntu omenyekha mena owiiya mena ntu o ishembwere thoko attu akina chiri aya. Kinooshukuru tho akirii thoko ntu olhiviha ikhodi emenlhe ulha va. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Kinoottuka mahuku melhi kila ijuma, kikumihaka ikikhumi yo nhakhu kinopatta aka.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Nansho olhiviha ikhodi ayo, eemenlhe utayi oochelhaka upathusha miitho wiirimu, nansho echaataka vakhakaachani onlhaka ahiyereriye, eeraka, ‘Nlhuku nkoonelhe ikiriri mii ntu o uwonya va!’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, “Ntu olhiviha ikhodi ulhe aahokolheelhe uwani naalhakelhiye ikekhia. Nansho kuhiwe wa Afarisayo ayo, ukhalhawaya kila neewelhiha nookurushiya, ni kila neekurusha noowelhihiya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noweeshera miono ashaana ashinkani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mak 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Attu nkayammwiihera Yesu ashaana ashinkani awe eesheracha miono chawe. Owiittucha vonne aya nkaachiichihacha ni waachacheracha. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Nansho Yesu nkeehanacha eeraka, “Mwaahiye ashaana ashinkani ayo we uwannyaka, mena nhaachiichihe, ukhalhawaya Imwene ya Nlhuku phi yawaya attu thoko alha. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Muupuwelheke wo ikekhiaye wiira, ntu riyoothe hinopochera Imwene ya Nlhuku thoko mwaana mwankani khanowa aakhelha mwiimweneni.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntu o nhakhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mak 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Nholhelhi mmoka a Ayahudi nkankoha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha orera nrima, kipangeke ittu yaani kipatte ukumi wo uhimalha?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu ni uyo nkaakoha, “Chani woonaka nnokiihana orera nrima? Khaawo ri orera nrima ahikhalhe Nlhuku vekha awe. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Nhochuwelha malheheriyo, ‘Nhilhavelhave, nhiive, nhiiye, nhimwootherie ntu, mwaathimicheke athumwaninyu ni anumwaninyu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Nholhelhi uyo nkeera, “Mii kihovara yayo meettuchiho ayo toka kinari mwanhima.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu veewilhe awe, nkaamwirelha, “Nhohalhiha nimoka nnothananiya inyu upanga. Nthumiheke chittu chinyu chonkhaye ni nchurukhu uyo mwaavaheke amashikini, ni inyu nnowiishungera nhakhu wiirimu, mwamalhaka vavawo nkittwareke.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Nansho ntu ulhe veewilhe awe chiicho, nkaakelhiya ichuku chinene, ukhalhawaya aari ntu o nhakhu chinene.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu nkoona ichuku chawe nkaamwirelha, “Vari voorikarika chinene attu o nhakhu ukelha wi Imwene ya Nlhuku! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Eiyo, khavanorikarika wa ingamiya uperetta va niitho no ntotto, kuliko wa ntu o nhakhu ukelha wi Imwene ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Attu yeewa nkayeera, “Mpani etu, nohalha ulhama?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chihinooria wa nttuni, chinowooria wa Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Paahi Napeturo nkayeera, “Mwooneke etu, hii nihohiya kila ittu ni uuttwarani inyuva.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu nkeerelha attu onkhaye, “Eiyo, ikekhia kinouhimeriani, ntu riyoothe hilhe inupa awe ama amwaarawe ama ashihima awe ama manyanaangoro awe ama ashaana awe wo uttwara Imwene ya Nlhuku <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />nowa upochera menchi wo upwaha ilha ikatema ilha ni ukumi wo uhimalha ikatema inowa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonhimiacha nookhwa awe voneraru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mak 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu nkaakusha owiittucha khumi ni elhi vachereshere nkeerelha, “Mwiiwelhelheke! Vano ninokelha Uyerusalemu, wowo kila ittu ilhepiye ni anamilhohi inomwaacha Mwaana a Ntu inokootimira. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Nokoovariya ni attu ahiri Ayahudi anohalha umpangelhacha ncheche, ni unruwana ni unshuwelha ishenye. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Anokoomwaata ni umwiiva, nansho nihuku no neraru noohihimmwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Nansho owiittucha khayaari achuwelhaka yoyo mwaha uyo, maana aya aari anavithiye, ahichuwelhaka ittu yaahimia awe Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu ohoona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mak 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu vaatameria awe Uyeriko, ahomphwanya ntu mmoka ohoona aakhanlhe vachereshere iphiro, avekelhaka. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Veewa awe attu enchi aviraka ahokoha, “Anaa urini?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Nkaakhulhiya wiira, “Yesu o Unazareti phi novira.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Nkaakhuwelha eeraka, “Yesu! Mwaana a Adaudi ukoonelhe ikiriri!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Attu aaholhenlhe ayo nkanchachera wiira amaalhe. Nansho uyo nkaathepa ukhuwelha, “Mwaana a Adaudi, ukoonelhe ikiriri!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu nkeemelha ni ulhehera wiira ehaniye. Vaawiihiye awe, Yesu nkankoha, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Unothanana kuupangelheke ittu yaani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Nkaakhulha, “Thithi, kinolhepelha woona.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Uvahiyeke woona etu! Nrima awo uhoolhamiha.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Yeyo ikatema, ohoona ulhe nkoona, nkanttwara Yesu uno anthimichaka Nlhuku. Attu onkhaye vonne aya, nkayanthimicha Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Nazakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu nkaaphiya Uyeriko, nkeetakacha mmaphironi. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Wowo ahaawo ntu olhiviha ikhodi mulhupalhe eehaniya Zakayo. Yoyo aari ntu o nhakhu. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Aari athananaka umwoona Yesu chiri awe, nansho aari akani o khuvia oocheelhaka umwoona Yesu rata wo nlhatu no uchara attu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Paahi etu nkaattimakacha uholho, nkaawelha munkhuyuni amwoone Yesu rata vanohalha awe uvira. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu vaaphilhe awe vavawo, nkaaweha nchulhu ni uwerelha Nazakayo, “Nazakayo, nkhuruweke mwaakuvieke, lhelho mii ki nlheto uwaninyu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Nazakayo nkayaakhuruwa ni umpochera Yesu athaatheelhaka. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Attu onkhaye oona nkayaachukulhacha, “Yolha ntu ulha nokelha uukhalhani wa ntu o uwonya!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Nazakayo nkayeemelha ni wiihimia wa Athithi, “Mwiiweke Thithi! Kinookumiha inusu yo nhakhu aka waavaha amashikini, ni yakhalhaka hawo ntu kanthurunlhe aka ittu, kinonhokolhoshera vacheshe.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu nkeera, “Lelho, inupa inyu ihoopolhiya, ukhalhawaya ulha ri uwaninyu ulha ri o iyari ya Aburahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mwaana a Ntu wiilhe waathotha ni woopolha attu apotenre.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho ni akarumiya khumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Attu vaamwiwelhelha aya, Yesu nkaathepa nkaahimeria wo malhikaaniho. Vavawo aari aatameriaka uphiya Uyerusalemu, ni attu yaanyiheraka vano wiira Imwene ya Nlhuku waanonia chitema. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Paahi etu nkeera, “Ahaawo ntu o iyari ye Imwene aarweelhe nkwaha wo utayi apochere umwene, vanomalha awe ahokolhie. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Vaari awe hinaya uthama, nkeehanacha akarumiya awe khumi ni waavaha kila mmoka nchurukhu wo ulhikaana ni umwiirelha, ‘Mpangelheke maronda mpaka vanohokolhia aka.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Nansho attu o uwannyawe yaari anvengaka, nkayaaruma akarumiya arwee aahimerie attu ammara nchina wiira, ‘Khaninaattuna ahivariye umwene.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Ntu uyo nkaavariya umwene nkaahokolhia uwani. Vaahokolhelhe awe, nkaalhehera eeraka wiira akarumiya aavanhe awe nchurukhu ayo ehaniye awe aalhakelha ifaida apantte aya. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />O upacha nkaawa eeraka, ‘Pwiiya, kihopatta nchurukhu nkina mikwaha khumi wo nchurukhu mmoka mwaakivanhe inyu ulhe.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Nkaakhulhiya, ‘Aye, anamitheko oombone inyu! Nhokhulhuvelhiya wo makani, kinouvahani vano ikuru yulhupalhe yo weemelhelha iwani khumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Karumiya o nayelhi nkaawa eeraka, ‘Pwiiya, kihopatta ifaida mikwaha nthanu vachulhu nchurukhu waakivanhe inyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Yoyo nkaakhulhiya eerelhiyaka, ‘Nnoweemelhelha iwani nthanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Karumiya nkina nkaawa nkeera, ‘Pwiiya, nchurukhu wo idhahabu inyu ulha va, kahovitha vanlhutoni. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Kaari kuwoovakani, ukhalhawaya inyu attu o urikarika. Nnokusha ittu ihiri yawinyu ni ukhungura vahaanlhe inyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Yoyo aakhulhiye wiira, ‘Karumiya o uhilhoka uwe! Kinouhukumulhani wo nuulhumo ninyu! Wahochuwelha wiira mii kiri ntu orikarika, kinokusha ittu ihiri yawaka ni ukhungura vahaanlhe aka. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Aye, woonaka khawarweehilhe unoshungiya nchurukhu? Wowo kaanopatta ifaida yo wuncherera vanohalha aka urwa uhokolhoshani.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Paahi etu, nkeerelha attu yeemenlhe vavawo ayo, ‘Munthurulheke nchurukhu uyo, nkusheke nrweeke mwammaheke karumiya pantte ifaida mikwaha khumi uyo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nansho attu ayo nkayeera, ‘Pwiiya woonaka hopatta ifaida mikwaha khumi upwaha nchurukhu waanvanhe inyu!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Nkayaakhulha, ‘Kinouhimeriani wiira attu arina ittu, anowunchereriya, nansho attu ahirina ittu, ata ikani irina aya iyo inookushiya <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ni vano kineera, attu anokivenga wiira kihivariye umwene ayo, mwaawiiheke vaa, eevakachiye vava koonaka kimwanene!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Upocheriya wo nkhito Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu amalhiheke wulhumacha, nkaaholhelha urwaa Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Vaaphiya awe Ubetifage ni Ubethaniya uri Mwaako wo Mizeituni, ahaaruma owiittucha awe elhi anholhelhe <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />aalheheraka eeraka, “Nrweeke iwani iri uholho iyo, vanophiya inyu, nnokomphwanya mwaaphuta nattukelhelhiye hinaya weetihiya ni ntu. Mwanthaphulheke mwammwiiheke vaa.<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwaaphuta</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ntu riyoothe okohakani woonaka nnonthaphulha, mwamwiirelheke wiira, Athithi anonthanana.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Nkayaarwaacha ni uphwanya kila ittu thoko chaahimeriye aya ni Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Vanthaphulha aya mwaaphuta uyo, ashinene nkayaakoha, “Chani woonaka mwaatti nnonthaphulha mwaaphuta uyo?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nkayaakhulha, “Athithi phi nonthanana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Nkayankusha mwaaphuta unrwehelha Yesu. Nkayaathalhacha ikuwo vanthanani ni ummwelhiha Yesu akhalhe vachulhu vawe. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Vaamweetiha awe, attu nkayaathalhacha ikuwo chaya mphironi nkaavira vachulhu ikuwo vawo.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Vaatameria awe Uyerusalemu, iphiro yaakelha uri Mwaako wo Mizeituni, nlhoko mwinchi wa owiittucha awe nkawaachokholha untotopelha Nlhuku akhuwelhaka voona aya cho ushangiha chonkhaye choona aya, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Yaari akhuwelhaka, “Nlhuku ammahe ibarakha mwene nowa wo nchina no Athithi uyo! Mpuha ukhalhe wiirimu ni nthimicho wa Nlhuku wiirimu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Amafarisayo akina munlhokoni mmo nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha, mwaamaalhiheke owiittucha inyu ayo!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kinouhimeriani wiira, kaamaalhihaka, malhuku anoweemelha ni ukhuwelha.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowunlhelha iwani yo Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Nkaatameria iwani, ni vawo vonne awe, nkaamoriha miithori o nlhelhaka attu o Uyerusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />eeraka, “Mwakaachuwenlhe lhelho chittu chimmwiiha mpuha! Nansho chihovithiya uwaninyu. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ukhalhawaya mahuku anoowa amalhaponi inyu vanohalha aya urukurerihani ntuto, othothokelhakani kila mpatta. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Anowa uunyikalhachani inyuva vamoka ni attu inyu nlhuwanini mwinyu, ahihalhihaka ata nlhuku nimoka vachulhu nlhuku nikina, wo nlhatu noohichuwelha nihuku Nlhuku naawilhe awe uwoopolhani.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nookelha Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mak 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu nkaarwa ni Inupa ya Nlhuku nkaachokholha woomolha vathe attu yaapanga maronda, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />eerelhaka, “Iholhepiya, Nlhuku heera, ‘Inupa aka inohalha ukhalha inupa yo lhapelha attu.’ Nansho mwaattiva nhorukunusha ukhalha nikhuku no attu o uvara makhuche!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kila nihuku Yesu nkeettuchiha attu upuwani u Inupa ya Nlhuku. Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero, ni ahoolhelhi a attu yaari athananaka umwiiva, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />nansho khayaari ni iphiro yo wiira ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye aari amwiiwelhelhaka, ahittunaka ukufia ata nlhove nimoka.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ukohereriya ikuru ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mak 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Nihuku nimoka Yesu veettuchiha awe u Inupa ya Nlhuku, ahimiachaka Malhove Orera, opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero, vamoka ni ashulhupalhe wahowiya, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />nkayaamwiirelha, “Nnihimerie! Nnopanga chi chittu chi wo ikuru ya apani?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nkani ni mii kuukoheni nlhove. Nkakihimerieni etu, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />ikuru i Nayohana yo waabatiiza attu yaakhumme wa Nlhuku wiirimu ama wa attu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Nkayaachokholha ukohanacha ashineneru, “Nimwaakhulheke chani? Neeraka, ‘Wa Nlhuku wiirimu’ no wiira, ‘Chani woonaka khamwaarumelhenlhe Nayohana ayo?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Neerakaru, ‘Yaakhumme wa attu,’ alha attu onkhaye alha anoonata malhuku, ukhalhawaya attu onkhaye yanrumelhelha wiira Nayohana aari anamilhohi a Nlhuku.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Paahi etu nkayaakhulha wiira, “Hii khanichuwenlhe waakhumme aya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Ata mii akinouhimeriani kimpanga chii wo ikuru yo ukhuma vayi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no imata yo zabibu ni anamalhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mak 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Paahi Yesu nkaahimeria attu nna nlhikaaniho nna, “Ahaawo ntu mmoka aalhimme imata yo zabibu, nkaashimiha wa anamalhima, nkaarwa nkwaha wo utayi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Nlhaalha waayeke, nkanruma karumiya arwee apochere mahalha o izabibu. Nansho anamalhima alhe nkayaamwata karumiya uyo, nkayanhokolhosha mathatharu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nkayanruma karumiya nkina, nansho anamalhima ayo nkayanruwanakacha, nkaahokolhia mathatharu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nkanruma tho karumiya o neraru, anamalhima ayo nkayanrakalhiha ni uyo, ni umwoomolha umatani. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yamalhekeru anene imata yo zabibu nkayeera, ‘Vano kiireke chani? Kinonruma mwaamwanaka kinonttuna aka, ulha anokonlhoha!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Nansho anamalhima vaamwonne aya, nkayeeracha ashineneru, ‘Ulha phi mwaamwanaya nohalha uhiyeriya nhakhu. Nngwee nimwiive, nhakhu awe uyo ukhalheke wawihu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Paahi etu nkayankakhelha uchereshere imata yo zabibu nkayaamwiiva.” Yesu nkaakoha, “Vano anene imata ayo, anohalha weeriha chani anamalhima alhe? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Anene imata ayo anowa weeva yayo anamalhima ayo, ni uwaashimiha attu akina imata aya iyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Attu veewilhe aya, nkayeera, “Mena ahiniphwanye hii yayo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu nkaaweha nkaakoha, “Haya etu alha Malhove Matakatifu alha anohimiani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Nlhuku nikhotiye ni atheki wiira khaninlhoka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">nihokhalha vano nlhuku no nsingi no vakhoonani.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha ukwakwathuwa nenno nlhuku nno nowunthakiacha, ni nno nammulhuwelhaka ntu, ninonhararia.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo ulhiva ikhodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mak 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Owiittuchiha Malhehero ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaalhikacha ummara Yesu vavawo, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha wiira aahimiacha nenno nlhikaaniho nno aachaka, nansho nkayoova attu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Paahi nkayaavia ikatema yoombone. Nkayaahonga attu o wiipangapanga arwee yankohache chookohiya choonria. Vavawo apatte iphiro yo ummara ni unrweeha wa attu o ikuru yo utawara o Urumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Yayo attu yaarumiye ayo, nkayaamwiirelha, “Owiittuchiha, nihochuwelha wiira, nri o wiiraniha. Nihochuwelha wiira, khannomova ntu, nnohimiacha ikeekhene yo iphiro ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Nnihimerieke etu, iri yo urera ama yo unanara hii waalhiva ikhodi Nakaisari?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Nansho Yesu ahochuwelha nriankho aya uyo, nkeerelha, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Nkakooniheni nikhobilhi no nchurukhu. Ilha ikhove ni nchina nna cha apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Nkayaakhulha, “Chi Nakaisari.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Paahi Yesu nkeera, “Morera, paahi etu, mwaalhiveke Nakaisari iri ya Nakaisari, ni unlhiva Nlhuku iri ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Nkayoochelha ummara wo nlhove niriyoothe vaattuni vawo, paahi nkayaamaalha athikhinaka chenre awe wo waakhulha.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo uhihimmwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mak 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Amasadukayo akina, attu yaakhota wiira attu akhwilhe kanhihimwa, nkayaawa wa Yesu unkohani, nkayeera, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Owiittuchiha, ashinna Musa ahonilhehera wiira, ‘Nlhopwana akhwaakaru ni waahiya mahanu awe ahinayara, ahima awe akelheke manupa annyarelheke ashaana ntu khwilhe uyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ahaawo ashilhoko saba o irukulhu imoka, olhupalhe ayo ahothelha nkaakhwa wo uhaahiya ashaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />O nayelhi nkaakhelha manupa, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />o neraru chiicho. Nkayeeriya chiichammo wa attu saba onkhaye nkayaakhwacha wo haahiya ashaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Wo umalhihera opani ayo nkayaakhwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />vano etu, nihuku no uhihimushiya attu akhwilhe nno, apani anohalha ukhalha phi owannyaya athiyana alhe? Ukhalhawaya onkhaye saba ahaathelha.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Attu o ilha ilhapo ilha anoothelha ni uthelhiya, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />nansho attu Nlhuku nohalha awe waahihimusha ikatema yo uhihimushiya attu, khanowa aathelha mena uthelhiya. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Anowa ukhalha thoko minepa mena khanowa aakhwa. Anowa ukhalha ashaana a Nlhuku ahihimushiye nnookhwani. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Nansho ashinna Musa ahomalha uhimiecheshani wiira attu akhwilhe anoohihimushiya nnookhwani. Vari nlhako unohimiacha mwaha wo ithuphi yaapharelha, inohimia wiira, Athithi phi, ‘Nlhuku a Aburahimu ni Nlhuku a Naisaka ni Nlhuku a Nayakhobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Paahi etu ri Nlhuku a attu akumi, kahiwe a attu akhwilhe, ukhalhawaya uwannyawe khaawo nookhwa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Owiittuchiha akina nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha, vavawo nhaakhulha rata!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />olhumanche chiicho ukhalhawaya khayaarina chookohiya chikina tho.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukohereriya mwaha wa Kuristo Moopolhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mak 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu nkaakoha, “Inooria chani wiira Kuristo thanlhiye ni Nlhuku, mwaana a Adaudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Adaudi anene nhina ichipo cho Izaburi aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Athithi aheerelha Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Nkhalheke wiimonono waka<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mpaka vanohalha aka waathalha amalhaponi inyu wuuthi inyaa chinyu wiira mwaakalhelhe.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Yakhalhaka Adaudi ehanne yayo, ‘Athithi’, vano etu, ineeria chani Moopolhi ukhalha mwaana a Adaudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaamuka Owiittuchiha Malhehero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Attu onkhaye vaari aya amwiiwelhelhaka, Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mwiichinanelheke ni owiittuchiha Malhehero, anottuna weetakacha anawanre ikuwo cho utalhiva ni uchivelhiya ukohachiya wo nthimicho vakittu vanopangachiya maronda, athanlhaka mapuro o nthimicho mmanupani mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku ni mmanupani munoterekhiya ikaramu, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />anaathurulhacha anankhwelhi ni wiipanga attu o ulhapelha wo ulhapelha ikatema yinchi! Yayo anowa uhukumulhiya ntwarusho wo uweria chinene!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka ya anankhwelhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mak 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu nkaaweha rata, nkoona attu o nhakhu cheera aya wo ukumiha isadaka chaya mphacheni Inupa ya Nlhuku, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />nkoona tho, opani ashikini amoka amorihaka isenti pilhi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Nkeera, “Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira alha opani ashikini alha ahokumiha waapwaha attu onkhaye akuminhe muu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ukhalhawaya attu o nhakhu ayo akuminhe isadaka inokhuma mu ifaida yo munhakhuni mwaya, nansho opani alha, ni ushikini urina aya, akuminhe ittu yaakhulhuvelha aya.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noohimiacha uphomolhiya wa Inupa ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mak 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Owiittucha akina aari aarerihaka wi Inupa ya Nlhuku mwaha wo urera malhuku athekelhiye inupa ayo, vamoka ni isadaka chikumihiye wa Nlhuku. Yesu nkeera, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Alha malhuku athekelhiye ishiri onkhaye nnona inyu alha, anoowa mahuku vanohalha aya uhihalha vaa ata nlhuku nimoka vachulhu nikina, kila ittu inoophomolhiya.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhuva ni uvelhavelha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mak 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, yayo malhove ayo anowa ukhumelhelha iyaakhani? Ni ithikineha yaani inowa unichuwelhiha wiira ikatema ihaaya?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nhiitialhe, nhiwe mwaathepiya. Attu enchi, anowa wiipanga phi mii, eeraka, ‘Miyaano phi Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku!’ Nkina eeraka, ‘Ikatema ihaaya!’ Nansho mwaattiva nhaatware. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Nhiwe mwoova vanohalha inyu wiiwa mwaha wo ikhoto ni uthemwathemwa, yayo ahothananiya uwa, nansho kuhiwe phi umalha wo chittu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Nkaahimeria tho, “Makosho anowa waatakana nimoka ni nikina, imwene chinowa chaatakana chineneru. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Ilhapo inowa utikhinyia chinene ni ikuruna ni mareta. Unowa ukhumelhelha mwaha wo woopiha attu ni ithikineha chulhupalhe chikhumaka wiirimu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Nansho yayo ahinaya, nnoowa mwaavariya, nkamwaatwarushiya ni urweehiya mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni ujeerani, nnowa urweehiya wo mamwene ni attu o utawara wo nlhatu no nchina naka. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Yeyo phi ikatema inyu yo uhimiechesha Malhove Orera uwannyaya. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mirima chinyu chihiwe chaathemwa, mena woova wiira nnohalha wiira chani wo wiivaraanga, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ukhalhawaya kinoowa koovahani malhove ni irusho chihinooria uvaanyihiya ni amalhaponi inyu. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Nnoowa mwaapangelhiya ichimwa ni manyanaangoro inyu ni ashilhoko inyu ni manyampwana inyu, ni akina munlhokoni mwinyu eeviyaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Kila ntu nowa uvengani wo nlhatu wo nchina naka. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />nansho khiiwo ata ikharari imoka mmuruni mwinyu inohalha upotera. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Wo uvilhelha winyu, nnowiichoopolha ukumi inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nohimiacha upohomolhiya iwani yo Uyerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mak 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Vanohalha inyu woona iwani yo Uyerusalemu inarukureriye ni amalhaponi, vavawo mmweeke mwaachuwelha wiira uhaaya wo uphomolhiya waya. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Vavawo etu attu arii Uyudea attawelheke umiakoni, attu arii vawani athamacheke, ni ayo ahiri vawani ayo ahihokolhie uwani. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ukhalhawaya yayo mahuku ayo phi ‘Mahuku o ntwarusho’, Malhove Matakatifu atimirihiye. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ahothapana manyoopani ari veruttuni ni ayo anaamwiha ashaana ashinkani yayo mahuku ayo! Ukhaalhawaya milhatu cho uhuva ni ntwarusho chinowa chaakhumelhelha velhaponi va, ni urushiya wa Nlhuku waawulhuwelhaka alha attu alha. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Attu akina anowa wiiviya wo uphanga, ni attu akina anowa ukushiya mateeka velhaponi vonkhaye, ni iwani yo Uyerusalemu inoowa yaanyikalhachiya ni attu ahiri Ayahudi, mpaka ikatema vanohalha aya utimira.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa wo Mwaana a Ntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mak 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Chinowa chaakhalha ithikineeha chinchi unchuwani ni mweeri ni ittotwa. Ilhapo chonkhaye velhaponi va, chinowa chaahuva, wo nlhatu nio nipampa nio woova nkhito wo iphioo cho mbaharini. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Attu anowa ukomwaacha wo nlhatu no woova, awehereraka mwaha unohalha ukhumelhelha velhaponi, ukhalhawaya machiri o wiirimu anowa utikhinyia. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Vavawo etu, mwaana a Ntu phi nowa awe, awaaka mmahuteni wo machiri ni nthimicho mwinchi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Yayo vanohalha aya uchokholha, mweemelheke rata ni utheesha miuru chinyu wiirimu, ukhalhawaya Moopolhi inyu ri vakhiviru.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wiittucha wo mwiri wo nkhuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mak 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesu nkaahimeria nlhikaaniho, “Nkoopuwelhani mwiri wo nkhuyu ni miri chikina chinchi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Vanoona inyu miri chiphuwaka, phi nochuwelha inyu wiira mmalha iyaakha vano. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Chiichammo etu vanohalha inyu woona alha onkhaye alha apangiaka, nnowa mwaachuwelha wiira, Imwene ya Nlhuku ihaatameria.”<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Wo ikekhiaye muupuwelheke wiira, ilha iyari ilha khinovira yayo ahinaya ukhumelhelha. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Irimu ni ilhapo chinoovira, nansho malhove aka khanovira mena.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nshelhelhiheke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Nkhalheke miitho! Mirima chinyu chihiwe chaalhemelhiya ni nikakata no chittu cho velhaponi ni uhapalhiya ni nipampa no iphiro cho mwiilhaponi. Mweettialhaka nenno nihuku nno ninowa <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />noovarakani thoko nriankho. Ukhalhawaya ninoowa naaphwanya attu onkhaye velhaponi va. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Nhiittialhe etu, nlhapelheke wo uhoochaa, mmwe mwaapatta machiri o uvira rata vanohalha aya uwa yayo malhove ayo, ni weemelha rata umihoolho wa Mwaana a Ntu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesu nkaalhokelha yayo mahuku ayo eettuchihaka attu Inupa ya Nlhuku, ni nchuwa veelha aya, aarwaa ulhokelhani uhiyu waari Mwaako wo Mizeituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Vaasha aya kila nihuku attu aari apeheriaka Inupa ya Nlhuku uumwiiwelhelhani.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Miruku cho umwiivelha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Nihuku no isikuukuu yo mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure yo Pasaka naari ninaatamenrie. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yaari yoovaka attu, paahi nkayaavia nipesha no unhelha Yesu mmachirini eeviye wo uhichuwania ni attu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nayuda anorumelhelha unthumiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mak 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Nakare nkaakelha Nayuda ehaniya Isikariote, mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi a Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Paahi etu Nayuda nkayaarwaa uupangani miruku ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ahoolhelhi yeemelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku chinohalha aya unthumiha Yesu uwannyaya. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nkayaateelhiya nkayeewanana ummaha nchurukhu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Nayuda nkayaarumelhelha, nkayaakhalha yaaviaka nipesha noombone no unrweeha Yesu attu ahichuwelhaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowiichesha tayari unlhia Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mak 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Nihuku nkanaaphiya no mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure mwaakhondoro o Pasaka vaakumihiya awe isadaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu nkaaruma Napeturo ni Nayohana eeraka, “Nrweeke mwaterekheke ikaramu yo Pasaka niwe naalhia.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Owiittucha ayo nkayankoha, “Nnothanana nirweeke naterekhelheke uuyi?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vanophiya inyu vawani, nnokomwoona ntu welhe mwaapu wo maashi. Mwanttwareke mpaka inupa inohalha awe ukelha, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />mwamwiirelheke, ‘Owiittuchiha aneera, iri vayi ichuumba inohalha aka unlhelhia pasaka vamoka ni owiittucha aka?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Nokowonihani ichuumba yulhupalhe iri inupa yo nchulhu, imanlhe urerihiya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Nkayarwaacha ni uphwanya kila ittu inari thoko chaahimmie awe Yesu, nkayaaterekhacha cholhia cho Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yolhia ya Athithi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mak 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Ako 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ikatema yaayeke, Yesu nkaakhalha ulhia yolhia vamoka ni akarumiya awe. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Nkeerelhacha, “Kaholhakelha chinene unlhia Pasaka ulha vamoka ni inyu mwaatti kihinaya uhuvihiya! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kinouhimeriani wiira, Akinowa kanlhia tho mpaka nihuku vanohalha aya utimira wi Imweneni wa Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Nkaawiaa ikikombe yo idivai, nkanshukuru Nlhuku, nkaavahacha eeraka, “Mmwieke nkawanacheke. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ukhalhawaya kinohimia wiira, ukhuma nna akinowuria tho idivai yo zabibu mpaka Imwene ya Nlhuku vanohalha aya uwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Nkaakusha nkatte, nkanshukuru Nlhuku, nkaamianiha, nkaavahacha, eeraka, “Ilha phi iruttu aka, nnovahiya inyu. Mpangeke chiicho wo ukuupuwelha.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Thoko chiichammo, nkaavahacha ikikombe vaamalhinhe aya ulhia, eeraka, “Ilha ikikombe ilha phi Malhehano o Naanano anohimiecheshiya ni iphome aka, inorihiaa wo nlhatu ninyu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Nansho, mwooneke! Ntu nokithumiha rii vava, nolhia vamoka ni mii! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mwaana a Ntu nookhwa thoko Nlhuku chenre awe wo uhimia, nansho hothapana yoyo ntu nohalha unthumiha uyo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Paahi nkayaachokholha ukohanacha ashineneru, phi mpani yoyo nohalha wiira chommo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaha wo ukohana mpani rii mulhupalhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Nkawaakhumelhelha uvaanyihana munlhokoni mwa owiittucha wiira mpani rii mulhupalhe aya. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Amwene o velhaponi va anaatawara attu ahiri Ayahudi wo ikuru, ehaniyaka ‘Manyampwana a attu’. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Nansho ihikhalhe chiicho uwaninyu mwaatti, ntu ri mulhupalhe munlhokoni mwinyu nophwanelhiya ukhalha mwankani waapwaha onkhaye munlhokoni mwinyu, ni nholhelhi akhalheke thoko namitheko. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Attu anaanyihera mulhupalhe phi mpani? Phi nokhalha uweherera aterekhelhiye ama naaterekhelha akina? Phi yoyo nokhalha ni uterekhelhiya. Nansho mii kiri va ukhalha namitheko inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Nholhokelha ni mii ikatema yonkhaye yo ulhikachiya waka, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />ni chiyo thoko chinre aya Athithi wo ukivaha mii Imwene, ni mii kinouvahani mwaatti Imwene iyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Nnowa mwaalhia ni uwuria vamoka ni mii wi Imwene aka, ni inyu nnowa ukhalhelha ihiche ye Imwene mwaahukumulhaka makosho khumi ni melhi o Uisraeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noolhohera ukhotiya ni Napeturo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Nasimoni, Nasimoni! Nkeewani! Nakare naavia nipesha no ulhikachani onkhaye, no uveera imbeyu ni iphepuwa, thoko namalhima chinoveera awe mmuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Nansho mii kihoulhapelhelhani, Nasimoni, wiira nrima winyu uhiwukuwe. Ni inyu vanohalha inyu ukihokolheelha, mmwe mwaahelha nrima ashilhoko inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Napeturo nkayeera, “Thithi, Kiri tayari uttukiya ata ukhwa vamoka ni inyu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu nkeera, “Napeturo kinouhimeriani wiira, nthupi uhinaya wiipa mapikoosha, nnowa mwaakiruna vararu wiira khankichuwenlhe mii.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nchako, Nrupa ni Uphanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu nkaakoha owiittucha awe, “Ikatema korumme akani wo hikusha nrupa wo nchurukhu mena nchako mena iraatu, chani mwahohuvelha ittu iriyoothe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Nkayaakhulhacha, “Ata mena.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu nkeera, “Nansho vano, ntu ri ni nrupa ama nchako wo nchurukhu akusheke, ni ntu hiri ni uphanga, athumiheke nikoti nawe athumeke. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Paahi kinouhimeriani wiira, Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Aheeshiya nlhoko mmoka ni attu o uwonya,’ anootimira, ukhalhawaya nlhove ninokaacha mii ninootimirihiya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Owiittucha nkayeeracha, “Thithi, mmweheke! Vaa ahawo maphanga melhi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Nkaakhulha, “Haya etu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noolhapelha u Mwaako wo Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mak 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu nkaathama ni urwaa waari Mwaako wo Mizeituni, aattukanaka owiittucha awe thoko cheera awe. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Vaaphilhe awe wowo, nkeerelhacha, “Nlhapelheke, nhiwe mwaawulhuwa muulhikachiyani.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Nkaahiyacha, nkaarwa vatayi vakani wo ntu uwonya nlhuku, nkaakhoroma ulhapelha. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Thithi, mwattunaka nthamiheke ilha ikikombe ilha. Nansho kuhiwe thoko chinothanana aka nansho mattunelho inyu, atimirihiye.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Nnepa wo wiirimu nkawaawa unhelha nrima. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ahuvaka chinene munrimani, nkaalhepelha wo machiri chinene, ntukutta thoko iphome nkanankhuma nkanaamora vathi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Amalhiheke ulhapelha, nkaahokolhelha owiittucha awe, nkaaphwanyacha anarumpe, ukhalhawaya aari anakelhiye ihuzuni. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Nkeerelhacha, “Chani woonaka nnorupa? Mweemelheke nlhapelheke wiira nhiwulhuwe muulhikachiyani.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noovariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoha 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu aari bado olhumachaka, mphingo wa attu vaawilhe aya, ahoolhelhiyaka ni Nayuda, mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi. Nkaawa ni uthanana unkumbatira Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nayuda, nnothanana unthumiha Mwaana a Ntu wo unkumbatira?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Owiittucha awe yooneke, nkayeeracha, “Thithi, chani nikumiheke mialho?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Mmoka aya nkanthikilha karumiya a Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni unkwatulha nnyaru no wiimonono.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nhiyeke, ilha ihothosha!” Nkankwakwanya nnyaru naakhapiye nno, nkaalhamiha.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Paahi etu, Yesu nkeerelhacha opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ahoolhelhi ni attu emelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku ni ashulhupalhe yaawiilhe ummara ayo, “Chani woonaka mmweelhe mialho chulhupalhe ni indonga uwa uukivarani thoko nnowa ummara ntu o uvara makhuche? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Kaari ni inyu mwaatti kila nihuku keettuchihaka Inupa ya Nlhuku, nansho khamwakivanre. Nansho vano phi ikatema inyu yo upanga, phi ikatema yo ikuru yo mwiipiphini.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napeturo anonruna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mak 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoha 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Nkayammara Yesu ni unrweeha upuwani wa Opochera ishaani olhupalhe, Napeturo attwaraka utayiutayi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Mooro waari unaparihelhiye variyari ipuwa, Napeturo nkayaakhalha wootta vamoka ni attu akina. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Karumiya mmoka nthiyana vonne aya anakhanlhe oottaka mooro, nkaaweha ni uhimia wiira, “Ulha ntu ulha chiicho aari vamoka ni Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Nansho Napeturo nkayaaruna, “Uwe nthiyana, akinchuwenlhe mii yoyo ntu uyo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Katashi tho, ntu nkina nkoona Napeturo nkeera, “Inyu mwaari mmoka aya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Nansho Napeturo nkaakhulha, “Uwe, mii akihiwe!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Yavireke isaa imoka, ntu nkina nkaamindelha, “Wo ikekhiaye, khiiwo yo ukhota, wiira ulha aari vamoka ni Yesu, ukhalhawaya ni uyo nokhuma Ugalilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Nansho Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Uwena, akichuwenlhe unhimia awo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Vavawo vavawo, anari olhumachaka, nthupi nkaweepa. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Athithi nkayaarukunuwa ni waaweha Napeturo wiitho. Napeturo nkayoopuwelha cheerelhiye aya ni Athithi, “Nthupi uhinaya wiipa mapikoosha, nnoowa mwaakiruna mikwaha miraru wiira khankichuwenlhe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Napeturo nkayaakhuma vathe, nkayonlha chinene.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noheulhachiya ni waatiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mak 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Attu anlhitelhelha Yesu ayo, nkayaamwata ni unheulhacha. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Nkayanttuka ikuwo wiitho ni unkoha, “Nlhamulheke mpani owatilheni!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nkayanruwanakacha chinene.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu upuwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mak 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoha 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Washeeke, ashulhupalhe ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna nkayaakumaana uwaamulhani, Yesu nkaawihiya upuwani. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nkayeeracha, “Unihimerieke, Uweva phi Kuristo Moopolhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mii kahimiaka, mwaatti khannokirumelhelha, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ni vavawo kookohakani, khannokaakhulha. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Nansho uchokholhelha nna Mwaana a Ntu nowa ukhalha wiimonono wa Athithi Nlhuku o machiri.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Attu onkhaye nkayeera, “Paahi niireke etu, uwe phi Mwaana a Nlhuku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Inyu mwaatti nhohimia, wiira phi mii.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ni ayo nkayeeracha, “Chani uhawo uhimiechesha ukina tho! Ukhalhawaya hohimiacha wo malhaku awe mwanene ni inyu nheewacha!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorweehiya u Napilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mak 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoha 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Nlhoko wonkhaye nkaweemelha ni unrweha Yesu mpaka u Napilato <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />waamwemenshe aya ni uchokholha uhimiacha milhatu, “Nahomwona ulha ntu ulha aapoterihaka attu o velhaponi, eerelhaka wiira ahilhive ikhodi wa Nakaisari ni wiichihana mwanene wiira, Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku mwene a Ayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Napilato nkayankoha Yesu, “Inyuva phi amwene a Ayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Thoko chinre inyu wo wulhumacha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Napilato nkayeerelha opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni attu wiira, “Akoonaka nlhatu uriwoothe wa ulha ntu ulha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Nansho attu nkayaathepa ukuruvalhelha wo machiri chinene, “Nowaachopeacha ni weettuchiha attu apange injoove ilhapo yonkhaye yo Uyudea. Aachokhonlhe Ugalilaya vano rii vaa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorweehiya u Naherode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Napilato veewilhe aya, nkayaakoha, “Kwani yolha ntu ulha nokhuma Ugalilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Vaachuwenlhe aya wiira aari ntu o ilhapo yo ikuru i Naherode, nkayanhokolhosha u Naherode uwo, aari yeyo ikatema iyo Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Naherode nkayaateelhiya nrima umwoona Yesu, ukhalhawaya yaari amwiiwaka athananaka umwoona toka khalhayi. Akhulhuvelhaka umwoona Yesu apangaka cho ushangiha. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Paahi etu Naherode nkayankoha Yesu chookohiya chinchi, nansho Yesu khaakhunlhe. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni owiittuchiha Malhehero yaari miholho ahimiachaka milhatu chinchi choomwootheria Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Naherode ni manyaaasikari aya nkayampangelha Yesu ncheche, nkayammwariha n'golole we imwene nkayanhokolhosha u Napilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Toka nenno nihuku nno, Napilato ni Naherode nkayaalhutanaacha umpwana, ukhalhawaya khalhayi vawo kila mmoka khaari ewananaka ni nkhunanawe.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noohukumulhiya wiiviya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mak 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoha 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Napilato nkayeehanacha opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ahoolhelhi ni attu vamoka, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nkayeera, “Nhommwiiha yolha ntu ulha uwannyaka mwiiraka wiira aari aapoterihaka attu. Vano etu, kihonkohacha mwaatti mwiiwaka, ni mii akoonne nlhatu uriwoothe uhimianche inyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Akihiwe mii vekha mena Naherode oonne nlhatu, phi nhokolhonshe aya uwanihu. Khuuwo nlhatu wo hii umwiiva. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Paahi mii kinomwaata ikopo ni unhiyerera.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kila nihuku no Pasaka, Napilato aari ni malhemalhelho o unhiyerera ntu mmoka ttukiye aathananiya ni attu.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Nlhoko wonkhaye nkawaakhuwelha, “Eeviye! Munhiyerereke Baraba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraba uyo aattukiye wo nlhatu no injoove yaapangeelhe vawani ni nlhatu no weeva attu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Napilato aari athananaka unhiyerera Yesu, paahi nkayoolhumana attu tho. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Nansho attu yaari akhuwelhachaka, “Munkhomelhelhe vansalaabani! Munkhomelhelhe vansalaabani!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Napilato nkayeera tho vo neraru, “Nansho ttenkeni? Khuuwo nlhatu kinoona aka wo umwiiva! Kinoomwata ikopo ni unthaphulha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Nansho attu nkayaathepa ukhuwelhacha avekelhaka wiira Yesu akhomelhelhiye, ni nlhove naya nkanaarumelhelhiya. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Paahi etu Napilato nkayanhukumulha Yesu thoko chaalhepelha aya attu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nkayanthaphulha Baraba, ntu aattukiye wo nlhatu no injoove ni niiviho, nkayaavaha Yesu wiira ampangeke ittu yaathanana aya, thoko chaavekelha aya.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nookhomelhelhiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Manyaasikaari nkayanvelhelha Yesu, vaarwaa aya nkayankumaana ntu o Ukirene nchina nawe Simoni aawa akhumaka umatani. Nkayanchuchumiha, nkayanriaa nsalaaba, akushe anttwaraka Yesu utulhi.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu nkawanttwara, akina aya yaari manyoopani onlhacha umunlhelha. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu nkaarukunuwelha, nkeerelha, “Manyopani o Uyerusalemu! Nhikunlhelhe mii, nansho mwichunlhelheke mwaashinene ni achishaana inyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ukhalhawaya mahuku anowa attu vanowa aya wiira, ‘Ahoreeriya manyaathiyana ahiyanre, ahaayanre ashaana mena ulhelha!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, attu phi nowa aya wiirelha miako, ‘Nniwulhuwelheke! Nnivitheke!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Vavawo attu aneera chiicho wo mwiri nkithi, mwiri wo wuuma inohalha wiiria chani?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Attu akina elhi, onkhaye o uwonya, yaari ni ayo arweehiyaka wiiviya vamoka ni Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Vaaphilhe aya vakittu vaneehaniya “Nikhurukucha no muru,” nkayankhomelhelha Yesu vavawo, ni attu elhi o uwonya, mmoka wiimonono ni nkina wiimushi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu nkeera, “Thithi mwaalhevelheke! Ukhalhawaya khachuwenlhe impanga aya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Nkayaakawanacha ikuwo chawe wo woopelha ikhura. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Attu nkayeemelhacha aawehaka Aholhelhi a Ayahudi vampangelha aya ncheche, “Ahoopolha attu akina, haya etu echopolheke mwanene yakhalhaka uyo phi Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Manyaasikaari ni ayo nkayampangelha ncheche chiicho, nkayaawa nkayammaha isiki, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />yiiraka, “Wiichopolheke umwanene wakhalhaka uwe phi mwene a Ayahudi!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Vachulhu nsalaaba nkayaakhomelhelha nipattu naalhempe aya malhove eera, “Ulha phi mwene a Ayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mmoka a attu yaakhomelhelhiye vamoka ni Yesu nkaachokholha unruwana Yesu, “Uwe kuhiwe phi Kuristo Moopolhi? Wiichoopolheke umwanene, unoopolheke ni hii!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Nkina uyo nansho, nkanchachera nkhunanawe eeraka, “Uwe khunomoova Nlhuku? Ihukumu ipantte awo iyo phi pantte awe. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Hii, ikekhiaye ihu iyo, phi niphwanenlhe, ukhalhawaya nihopochera malhivo o mitheko chihu, nansho uyo khawonnye ittu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Yesu wakuupuwelheke mii, vanohalha awo uwa unari Amwene vawo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Kinoolhelha wo ikekhiaye wiira lhelho nna, unowa waakhalha ni mii Uphiooni.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Yaari saa sita uthana nchuwa vaatiphiilhe aya, ipiphi nkayaawanelha ilhapo yonkhaye mpaka vaari aya saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Nipaziya nulhupalhe naattukelhelhiye variyari u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkanaahuwa velhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu nkaakhuwelha, “Thithi! Kinoweesha nnepa aka mmathathani mwinyu!” Voolhumanche awe chiicho, nkaarihiaa.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Nholhelhi a manyaasikari o Rumi nkoona cheeria, nkanthimicha Nlhuku, eeraka, “We ikekhiaye ulha aari ntu orera nrima!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Attu aathukumanne vavawo uweha chaapangiaa ahoona chikhumelhenlhe, nkayaathuruwa mmawani, echatakachaka ikhakacha wo wooniha ihuzuni. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Attu onkhaye anchuwenlhe Yesu, ikhalhaka vamoka ni manyoopani antwanre ukhuma Ugalilaya, yaari aneemenlhe utayi awehaka.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvithiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Ahokhalha attu amoka o rera nrima anenchi o Uarimathaya iwani yo Uyudea nchina naya Nayusufu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Yayo aari ntu o Uarimathaya, aapanga thoko Nlhuku chaathanana awe attuniyaka ni attu, awehereraka uwa wo Imwene ya Nlhuku. Inakhalhaka aari ntu o Ipuwa yulhupalhe ya Ayahudi, khaari arumelhelhaka ittu ipangiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yayo yahorwaa u Napilato nkayaavekelha avahiye iruttu ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Nkayaakurusha iruttu iyo vathi, nkaavilhikelha ikuwo yo hariri, nkayaavitha nnihiyeni mwaahemiye vamwalhani, nihiye naari bado uvithiya ntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Nenno naari nihuku no Ijumaa, Nihuku no Wiittuwa niwaaka meelho aya.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Manyopani yantwanre Yesu ukhuma Ugalilaya nkayarwaa ni Nayusufu uwinnuwelhani nihiye nivithiye awe Yesu. Nkayoona vavithiye aya iruttu awe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Nkayaahokolhiacha uwani nkayaakooroshacha makhura o unukhelha o uwa uuhikani iruttu ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Nihuku no Wiittuwa nkayeettuwa thoko Malhehero chaalhehera aya.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Uhihimmwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Mapikoosha o nihuku no Jumaapili manyoopani yahorwaa unihiyeni, anakushilhe makhura o unukhelha aakoronshe aya. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Nkayaaphwanya nlhuku ninapirikishiye ni uthama vanlhakoni vawo,<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Nlhuku nihopirikishiya vanihiyeni</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />paahi etu nkayaakelhacha nhina, nansho khayaaphwannye iruttu ya Athithi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Nkayeemelha ashangachaka yoyo mwaha uyo, wo uhikhulhuvelha, nkayaakhumelhelha attu elhi aawanre ikuwo chootelha chinene, eemelhaka waatameria. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Manyopani ayo yoovaka nkayaakhoromacha vathi, attu ayo veera aya, “Yeeshiyani umwaavia ntu nkumi mwa attu akhwilhe? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Khaawo vaa, hohihimwa. Muupuwelheke chenre awe wo uhimia vaari inyu Ugalilaya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Mwaana a Ntu hophwanelhiya uhelhiya mmathathani mwa attu o uwonya, akhomelhelhiye, ni nihuku no neraru ahihimmwe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Manyopani nkayoopuwelha malhove awe, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />nkayaakhuma nnihiyeni, nkayaahimiacha mwaha wonkhaye waahimiachera owiittucha khumi ni mmoka ahanlhe alhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Manyopani ayo yaari Amariamu Magidalena ni Nayoana ni Amariamu anumwanaya Nayakhobo, yayo ni manyoopani akina phi ahimianche wa akarumiya. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Nansho akarumiya nkayoona yayo malhove ayo thoko ncheche, khayaarumelhenlhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Nansho Napeturo nkayaarwaa unihiyeni attimakachaka, nkayooroma, vaathurumenlhe aya nkayoona ikuworu. Paahi nkayaahokolhia uwani ashangaka mwaha ukhumelhenlhe.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwaha wo Uemau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mak 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Nenno nihuku, owiittucha elhi a Yesu yaari akelhaka iwani yeehaniya Uemau, imaili saba ukhuma Uyerusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />arerihaka ashineneru mwaha wonkhaye upangeelhe. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Vaari aya eetaka arerihaka, Yesu mwanene nkaawa aatameriaka ni weeta vamoka ni ayo, <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />nkayaamwona, nansho ahinchuwelhaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Nnoopa mwaha waani mwaashineneru uno mweetaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Nkayeemelhacha, wiitho anachanre ihuzuni. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Mmoka aya eehaniya Nakileopa nkankoha, “Kwani inyuva alheto va Yerusalemu va, vekha nhinochuwelha chittu chipangelhe alha mahuku vakani avinre alha?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu nkaakoha, “Mwaha waani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Nkayaamwaakhulha, “Mwaha umphwannye Yesu o Unazareti. Yoyo ntu uyo aari namilhohi a Nlhuku aari ni ikuru wa Nlhuku ni wa attu yo upanga chittu ni wiittuchiha. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni ahoolhelhi ihu yahonkumiha wiira ahukumulhiye, nkaakhomelhelhiya. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Nansho hii nahonkhulhuvelha wiira phi nowa woopolha attu o Israeli! Upwaha vavawo, lhelho nihuku no neraru toka vaapangeelhe aya. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Tho manyoopani akina munlhokoni mwihu ahonithuthusha, yahorwaa unihiyeni lhelho wichishuru, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />nansho khayoonne iruttu iyo. Nkayaahokolhia eeraka wiira ahoona minepa chaahimmie wiira hohihimmwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Attu akina nkayaarwaa unihiyeni ni uphwanya thoko chaahimiye ni manyoopani alhe, nansho khayamwonne.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Vavawo etu Yesu nkeerelha, “Woonaka nhophupuwalha mwaatti ayi, wo mirima chimpicha urumelhelha malhove aahimiye ni anamilhohi a Nlhuku! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Chani, khawalhonke Kuristo Moopolhi thanlhiye ni Nlhuku uhuvihachiya, wiira akelhe rata munthimichoni mwawe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nkaapatakulhelha chittu chonkhaye chaamwacha nhina Malhove Matakatifu uchokholha wa ashinna Musa mpaka wa anamilhohi onkhaye.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Vaatameria aya iwani yaalhukama aya, Yesu nkeepanga thoko noopwaha vavawo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />nansho yayo manyaattu ayo nkayampepecha, eeraka, “Nkhalheke ni hii, uheelha.” Paahi etu nkaarwa uwannyaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Nkaakhalha ulhia yolhia vamoka, nkaakusha nkatte, nkaalhapelhelha ibarakha, nkaamia, nkaavahacha. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Miitho aya nkayaapatakulhiya nkayanchuwelha, nansho nkaapotera vamiithoni waya. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Nkayeera ashineneru, “Chani mirima chihu khachaari chipharelhaka mooro volhumachawe unilhamulhelha Malhove Matakatifu mphironi mmwe?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Yeyo ikatema nkayaathama nkayaahokolhia Uyerusalemu, nkayaaphwanyacha owiittucha khumi ni mmoka anathukumanne vamoka, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />eerachaka wiira, “Wo ikekhiaye, Athithi ahohihimmwa! Ahaakhumelhelha Nasimoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Owiittucha elhi nkayaahimiacha mwaha waakhumelhenlhe mphironi, ni chenre aya wo waachuwelha Athithi vaamianinhe aya nkatte wa Owiittucha aya.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaakhumelhelha Owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mitk 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Akarumiya elhi ayo vaari aya ahimiachaka yoyo mwaha uyo, wo uhiweherera, Athithi anene nkayeemelha variyari aya eeraka, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Nkayaathuthuwacha, yaanyiheraka wiira ahoona nshoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Nansho nkeerelhacha, “Nnoovani? Nnowelhiyani nipampa mu nrimani? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mmweheke mathatha ni mieto chaka, nkiweheke ni mii kimwanene. Nkikwakwanyeke, nnowoona wiira akiri nshoka, ukhalhawaya nshoka khanirina iruttu yo ithayi mena makhuva, thoko nnokoona inyu chi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nkeera chiicho oonihachaka mathatha awe ni mieto chawe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Akarumiya vaari aya ahirumelhelhaka ittu yoona aya, uno athepaka wuumiya uwanoni wo uteelhiya, Yesu ahaakohacha, “Nhanaa ittu yo ulhia va?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Nkayammaha ihopa yo waaneelhiya, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />nkaakusha nkaalhia amwoonaka.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Paahi nkaahimeriacha wiira, “Chilha phi chittu chaahimilhe aka ikatema vaari aka ni inyu. Ikhalhe wiira, kila ittu ilhepiye ikaachaka nhina Malhehero a ashinna Musa, chilhepiye ni anamilhohi ni Izaburi chihotimira.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Nkaapatakulha irusho chaya wiira achuwelhe Malhove Matakatifu <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />nkeerelhacha, “Phinre aya wo ulhepiya, Kuristo Moopolhi nowa uhuvihiya ni uhihimmwa nnookhwani aviraka nihuku no neraru, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />ni wo nchina nawe nttenga wo uhiyereriya uwonya unohimiachiya mwiilhaponi mwonkhaye, ichokholhaka Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Inyu phi o uhimiechesha chittu chonkhaye chi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ni mii kinommwiiha alhehiye ni Athithi uwaninyu. Nansho nnothananiya uweherera nnari iwani yuulhupalhe mpaka machiri o wiirimu vanohalha aya uwa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nookushiya wiirimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mak 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mitk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Paahi nkaaholhelha uthama vawani mpaka Ubethaniya, vaathenshe awe miono nkaavaha ibarakha. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Vaari awe aavahaka ibarakha, ahaahiya, nkaakushiya wiirimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Nkayanthimicha ni uhokolhia Uyerusalemu, wo mpuha mwinchi, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />nkayaalhokelhacha ikatema yonkhaye akhalhaka Inupa ya Nlhuku antotopelhaka Nlhuku.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>